"The TELEPORTER can PERMANENTLY change\\nPOKéMON into their GALARIAN "
"forms.\\nGALARIAN forms are NOT required\\nfor story progression "
"or\\nNATIONAL POKéDEX completion.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Le TELEPORTEUR change DEFINITIVEMENT\\ndes Pokémon en leur forme de "
"GALAR.\\nCes formes ne sont PAS requises\\npour l’histoire ni pour "
"compléter\\nle Pokédex NATIONAL.\\n"

