#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:1783
msgid ""
"They set off on their own from their pride\\nand live by themselves to "
"become stronger.\\nThese hot-blooded Pokémon are quick\\nto start a fight."
