"females\\nprotect the pride's cubs. They viciously\\nthreaten any "
"challenger."
msgstr ""
"Le mâle à la plus grande crinière de feu\\ndirige la troupe. Les femelles "
"protègent\\nles petits et menacent férocement les\\nintrus."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:1940
msgid ""
"This Pokémon spews flames hotter\\nthan 18,000 degrees Fahrenheit.\\nIt "
"swings around its grand, blazing\\nmane as it protects its allies."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon crache des flammes de\\nplus de 10 000 degrés. Il agite "
"sa\\ngrande crinière ardente pour\\nprotéger ses alliés."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:1990
msgid "FLABéBé"
msgstr "FLABEBE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:1993
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2099
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2372
