msgstr "PSYSTIGRI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2788
msgid "Restraint"
msgstr "Retenue"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2791
msgid ""
"It has enough psychic energy to blast\\neverything within 300 feet of "
"itself.\\nThe organ that emits its intense psychic\\npower is sheltered by "
"its ears."
msgstr ""
"Il a assez d’énergie psychique pour tout\\npulvériser dans un rayon de cent "
"mètres.\\nSes oreilles cachent l’organe qui l’émet."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2859
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2924
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2990
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3048
