msgstr "MISTIGRIX"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2862
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2927
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2997
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3055
msgid "Constraint"
msgstr "SelfContrôle"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2865
msgid ""
"The defensive instinct of the\\nmales is strong. It's when "
"they're\\nprotecting themselves or their partners\\nthat they unleash their "
"full power."
msgstr ""
"Le mâle a un instinct de défense très\\ndéveloppé. Il libère toute sa "
"puissance\\npour protéger ses partenaires et lui-même."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:2930
msgid ""
"Females are a bit more selfish and\\naggressive than males. If they\\ndon't "
"get what they want, they will\\ntorment you with their psychic abilities."
msgstr ""
"Les femelles sont un peu plus\\négoïstes et agressives que les mâles.\\nSi "
"on les contrarie, elles vous\\ntourmentent par leurs pouvoirs psy."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3000
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3058
msgid ""
"Mega Meowstic can use its psychic power\\nto compress or expand anything. "
"It\\noverwhelms foes by contorting space\\nitself."
msgstr ""
"MEGA-MISTIGRIX use de son pouvoir\\npsychique pour comprimer ou "
"dilater\\nn’importe quoi. Il écrase ses ennemis en\\ntordant l’espace lui-"
"même."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3109
