"patterns\\nof its two swords are unstoppable, even\\nagainst those skilled "
"at swordplay."
msgstr ""
"En évoluant, Monorpale se divise en deux\\népées. Leurs attaques complexes "
"sont\\nimparables, même pour les meilleurs\\nbretteurs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3253
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3331
msgid "AEGISLASH"
msgstr "EXAGIDE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3256
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3334
msgid "Royal Sword"
msgstr "Noble Lame"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3259
msgid ""
"In this defensive stance,\\nAegislash uses its steel body and a "
"force\\nfield of spectral power to reduce the\\ndamage of any attack."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à son corps en acier et à sa barrière\\nspectrale, il peut se défendre"
" en\\naffaiblissant toutes sortes d’attaques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3337
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, a king with an\\nAegislash reigned over the land. "
"His\\nPokémon eventually drained him of\\nlife, and his kingdom fell with "
"him."
msgstr ""
"Jadis, un roi régnait avec un\\nExagide. Ce Pokémon finit par\\ndrainer sa "
"vie, et son royaume\\ns’écroula avec lui."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3397
msgid "SPRITZEE"
msgstr "FLUVETIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3400
msgid "Perfume"
msgstr "Fragrance"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3403
msgid ""
"In the past, rather than using perfume,\\nroyal ladies carried a Spritzee "
"that would\\nwaft a fragrance they liked. Its fragrance\\nchanges depending "
"on what it has eaten."
msgstr ""
"Jadis, les dames de la cour portaient un\\nFluvetin en guise de parfum. Son "
"odeur\\nchange selon ce qu’il a mangé."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3472
msgid "AROMATISSE"
msgstr "COCOTINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3475
msgid "Fragrance"
msgstr "Parfum"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3478
msgid ""
"Its scent is so overpowering that,\\nunless a Trainer happens to really "
"enjoy\\nthe smell, he or she will have a hard time\\nwalking alongside it."
msgstr ""
"Son parfum est si capiteux qu’un Dresseur\\nqui n’apprécie pas son odeur "
"aura bien du\\nmal à cheminer à ses côtés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3540
msgid "SWIRLIX"
msgstr "SUCROQUIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3543
msgid "Cotton Candy"
msgstr "Confiserie"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3546
msgid ""
"Because it eats nothing but sweets, its\\nfur is as sticky sweet as cotton "
"candy.\\nTo entangle its opponents in battle, it\\nextrudes sticky white "
"threads."
msgstr ""
"Il ne mange que des sucreries, si bien que\\nson pelage est collant comme de"
" la barbe à\\npapa. Il ligote ses ennemis de fils blancs\\ngluants."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3615
msgid "SLURPUFF"
msgstr "CUPCANAILLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3618
msgid "Meringue"
msgstr "Mousseline"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3621
msgid ""
"Slurpuff can distinguish even the\\nfaintest of scents. It puts its "
"sensitive\\nsense of smell to use by helping pastry\\nchefs in their work."
msgstr ""
"Il distingue les odeurs les plus subtiles.\\nIl met son flair au service des"
" pâtissiers\\npour les aider dans leur travail."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3686
msgid "INKAY"
msgstr "SEPIATOP"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3689
msgid "Revolving"
msgstr "Rotation"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3692
msgid ""
"It flashes the light-emitting spots on its\\nbody, which drains its "
"opponent's will\\nto fight. It takes the opportunity to\\nscuttle away and "
"hide."
msgstr ""
"Il ébranle le moral de ses ennemis grâce\\naux clignotements qu’il émet. Il "
"profite de\\ncette diversion pour se cacher."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3757
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3828
msgid "MALAMAR"
msgstr "SEPIATROCE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3760
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3835
msgid "Overturning"
msgstr "Révolution"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3763
msgid ""
"It lures prey close with hypnotic motions,\\nthen wraps its tentacles around"
" it before\\nfinishing it off with digestive fluids. It\\nforces others to "
"do whatever it wants."
msgstr ""
"Il attire ses proies par des mouvements\\nhypnotiques, les enserre de ses "
"tentacules\\net les achève avec ses sucs digestifs."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3838
msgid ""
"It uses its colorful lights to\\noverwrite the personality and\\nmemories of"
" others-and to\\ncontrol them."
msgstr ""
"Il utilise ses lumières colorées pour\\nréécrire la personnalité et "
"les\\nsouvenirs des autres, et pour les\\ncontrôler."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3888
msgid "BINACLE"
msgstr "OPERMINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3891
msgid "Two-Handed"
msgstr "Bimane"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3894
msgid ""
"They stretch and then contract, yanking\\ntheir rocks along with them in "
"bold hops.\\nThey eat seaweed that washes up on\\nthe shoreline."
msgstr ""
"Ils prennent de l’élan avec tout leur corps\\net soulèvent leur pierre pour "
"se déplacer.\\nIls mangent les algues échouées sur le\\nrivage."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3961
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4031
msgid "BARBARACLE"
msgstr "GOLGOPATHE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3964
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4038
msgid "Collective"
msgstr "Assemblage"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:3967
msgid ""
"Barbaracle's legs and hands have minds\\nof their own, and they will "
"move\\nindependently. But they usually follow\\nthe head's orders."
msgstr ""
"Ses jambes et ses bras sont dotés d’une\\nvolonté propre. Cependant, ils "
"suivent\\ngénéralement les ordres de la tête."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4041
msgid ""
"It uses its many arms to toy\\nwith its opponents. This\\nkeeps the head "
"extremely busy."
msgstr ""
"Il se sert de ses nombreux bras pour\\nse jouer de ses adversaires. "
"Cela\\noccupe énormément sa tête."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4090
msgid "SKRELP"
msgstr "VENALGUE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4093
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4167
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4242
msgid "Mock Kelp"
msgstr "Simulalgue"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4096
msgid ""
"Camouflaged as rotten kelp, it hides\\nfrom foes while storing up power for "
"its\\nevolution. They spray liquid poison on\\nprey that approach unawares."
msgstr ""
"Déguisé en algue pourrie, il se cache et\\naccumule l’énergie pour évoluer. "
"Il crache\\nun poison liquide sur les proies distraites."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4164
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4235
msgid "DRAGALGE"
msgstr "KRAVARECH"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4170
msgid ""
"Their poison is strong enough to eat\\nthrough the hull of a tanker. Tales "
"are\\ntold of ships that wander into seas where\\nDragalge live, never to "
"return."
msgstr ""
"Son poison ronge la coque d’un pétrolier. On\\nraconte que les navires qui "
"s’égarent dans\\nles mers où il vit ne reviennent jamais."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4245
msgid ""
"It spits a liquid that causes the\\nregenerative power of cells to "
"run\\nwild. The liquid is deadly poison\\nto everything other than itself."
msgstr ""
"Il crache un liquide qui emballe la\\nrégénération des cellules. Ce "
"poison\\lest mortel pour tous les autres êtres\\lvivants."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4296
msgid "CLAUNCHER"
msgstr "FLINGOUSTE"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Lance à Eau
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4299
msgid "Water Gun"
msgstr "Pistolet à O"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4302
msgid ""
"Through controlled expulsions of internal\\ngas, it can expel water like a "
"pistol shot.\\nAt close distances, it can even shatter\\nlarge rocks."
msgstr ""
"En expulsant les gaz de son corps, il\\nprojette de l’eau comme un coup "
"de\\npistolet. A bout portant, il brise même les\\ngros rochers."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4368
msgid "CLAWITZER"
msgstr "GAMBLAST"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4371
msgid "Howitzer"
msgstr "Blaster"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4374
msgid ""
"By expelling water from the nozzle in the\\nback of its enormous claw, it "
"can move\\nat a speed of 60 knots. They launch\\ncannonballs made of water."
msgstr ""
"En expulsant de l’eau par l’arrière de sa\\npince géante, il file à plus de "
"100 km/h. Il\\ntire des boulets de canon en eau."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4442
msgid "HELIOPTILE"
msgstr "GALVARAN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4445
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4515
msgid "Generator"
msgstr "Générateur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4448
msgid ""
"They make their home in deserts.\\nThey can generate their own energy "
"from\\nbasking in the sun, so eating food is not\\na requirement."
msgstr ""
"Il vit dans le désert. Il produit sa propre\\nénergie en se dorant au soleil"
" et n’a donc\\npas besoin de manger."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4512
msgid "HELIOLISK"
msgstr "IGUOLTA"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Un seul Iguolta produit assez
#. d’électricité\npour alimenter un gratte-ciel. Il stimule\nses muscles pour
#. renforcer ses pattes.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4518
msgid ""
"A single Heliolisk can generate sufficient\\nelectricity to power a "
"skyscraper. It can\\nstimulate its muscles with electricity,\\nboosting the "
"strength in its legs."
msgstr ""
"Un seul IGUOLTA produit assez\\nd’électricité pour alimenter un\\ngratte-"
"ciel. Il stimule ses muscles\\npour renforcer ses pattes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4581
msgid "TYRUNT"
msgstr "PTYRANIDUR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4584
msgid "Royal Heir"
msgstr "Prince"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4587
msgid ""
"Its immense jaws have enough destructive\\nforce that it can chew up a car. "
"If\\nsomething happens that it doesn't like,\\nit throws a tantrum and runs "
"wild."
msgstr ""
"Ses énormes mâchoires peuvent broyer une\\nvoiture. Quand quelque chose lui "
"déplaît, il\\npique une colère et se déchaîne."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4651
msgid "TYRANTRUM"
msgstr "REXILLIUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4654
msgid "Despot"
msgstr "Tyran"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4657
msgid ""
"Thanks to its gargantuan jaws, which could\\nshred thick metal plates as if "
"they were\\npaper, it was invincible in the ancient\\nworld it once "
"inhabited."
msgstr ""
"Dans les temps anciens, aucun Pokémon ne\\npouvait rivaliser avec lui. Ses "
"mâchoires\\nréduisent une plaque de métal en\\nconfettis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4719
msgid "AMAURA"
msgstr "AMAGARA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4722
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4798
msgid "Tundra"
msgstr "Toundra"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4725
msgid ""
"This ancient Pokémon was restored from\\npart of its body that had been "
"frozen in\\nice for over 100 million years. It lived in a\\ncold land where "
"there were no predators."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon antique a été ressuscité à\\npartir d’un fragment gelé depuis "
"plus de\\n100 millions d’années. Il vivait dans un\\npays froid sans "
"prédateurs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4795
msgid "AURORUS"
msgstr "DRAGMARA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4801
msgid ""
"Using the diamond-shaped crystals on its\\nbody it can instantly create a "
"wall of ice\\nto block an opponent's attack, or encase\\nthem in ice."
msgstr ""
"Grâce aux cristaux en losange de son\\ncorps, il crée en un instant un mur "
"de glace\\ncontre les attaques, ou y enferme ses\\nennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4868
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4941
msgid "HAWLUCHA"
msgstr "BRUTALIBRE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4871
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4948
msgid "Wrestling"
msgstr "Catcheur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4874
msgid ""
"With its wings, it controls its position in\\nthe air. Its proficient "
"fighting skills\\nenable it to keep up with big bruisers\\nlike Machamp and "
"Hariyama."
msgstr ""
"Il se dirige dans les airs avec ses ailes.\\nSes talents de lutteur lui "
"permettent de\\ntenir tête à Mackogneur ou Hariyama."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:4951
msgid ""
"Mega Evolution has pumped up all\\nits muscles. Hawlucha flexes to\\nshow "
"off its strength."
msgstr ""
"La Méga-Evolution a gonflé tous ses\\nmuscles. BRUTALIBRE prend la "
"pose\\npour exhiber sa force."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5000
msgid "DEDENNE"
msgstr "DEDENNE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5003
msgid "Antenna"
msgstr "Antenne"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5006
msgid ""
"Its whiskers serve as antennas.\\nBy sending and receiving "
"electrical\\nwaves, it can communicate with others\\nover vast distances."
msgstr ""
"Ses moustaches lui servent d’antennes\\npour envoyer et recevoir des signaux"
" et\\ncommuniquer à distance avec ses\\ncongénères."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5071
msgid "CARBINK"
msgstr "STRASSIE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5074
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7272
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7350
msgid "Jewel"
msgstr "Joyau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5077
msgid ""
"Born from the high temperatures and\\npressures deep underground, it "
"defends\\nitself by firing beams from the jewel part\\nof its body."
msgstr ""
"Les Strassie sont nés sous terre, à de\\nhautes pressions et températures. "
"Ils se\\ndéfendent en lançant des lasers depuis\\nleurs cristaux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5148
msgid "GOOMY"
msgstr "MUCUSCULE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5151
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5225
msgid "Soft Tissue"
msgstr "Mollusque"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5154
msgid ""
"Its source of protection is its slimy,\\ngerm-laden mucous membrane. "
"Anyone\\nwho touches it will need some thorough\\nhand-washing."
msgstr ""
"Il se protège grâce à sa membrane\\nvisqueuse pleine de germes. Quiconque "
"le\\ntouche a intérêt à bien se laver les mains."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5222
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5368
msgid "SLIGGOO"
msgstr "COLIMUCUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5228
msgid ""
"This Pokémon's mucous can dissolve\\nanything. Toothless, it sprays "
"mucous\\non its prey. Once they're nicely dissolved,\\nit slurps them up."
msgstr ""
"Comme il n’a pas de dent, il sécrète un\\nsolvant dont il asperge ses proies"
" pour les\\nliquéfier et les boire en smoothie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5292
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5449
msgid "GOODRA"
msgstr "MUPLODOCUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5298
msgid ""
"It gets picked on because it's meek.\\nBut then, whoever teased it gets to "
"feel\\nthe full force of its horns and a good\\nswatting from its thick "
"tail."
msgstr ""
"Ceux qui l’importunent en le pensant\\ninoffensif se retrouvent vite du "
"mauvais\\ncôté de ses cornes et goûtent de sa\\npuissante queue."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5366
msgid "SLIGGOO-H"
msgstr "COLIMUCUS-H"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5379
msgid ""
"A creature given to melancholy.\\nIts metallic shell developed as a\\nresult"
" of the mucus on its skin reacting\\nwith the iron in Hisui's water."
msgstr ""
"Une créature d’humeur mélancolique. Sa\\ncarapace métallique est née du "
"mucus de sa\\npeau, qui a réagi au fer contenu dans l’eau\\nde Hisui."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5447
msgid "GOODRA-H"
msgstr "MUPLODOCUS-H"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5457
msgid "Shell Bunker"
msgstr "Bunker"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5460
msgid ""
"It loathes solitude and is extremely\\nclingy--it will fume and run riot "
"if\\nthose dearest to it ever leave its\\nside."
msgstr ""
"Il déteste la solitude et se montre\\ntrès collant. Il enrage et "
"se\\ndéchaîne si ses proches\\ns’éloignent de lui."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5528
msgid "KLEFKI"
msgstr "TROUSSELIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5531
msgid "Key Ring"
msgstr "Trousseau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5534
msgid ""
"These key collectors threaten any\\nattackers by fiercely jingling their "
"keys\\nat them. It will sneak into people's homes\\nto steal their keys."
msgstr ""
"Ce collectionneur de clés effraie ses\\nennemis en les faisant tinter. Il se"
" glisse\\ndans les maisons pour voler les clés des\\ngens."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5605
msgid "PHANTUMP"
msgstr "BROCELOME"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5608
msgid "Stump"
msgstr "Souche"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5611
msgid ""
"According to legend, medicine to cure\\nany illness can be made by plucking "
"the\\ngreen leaves on its head, brewing them,\\nand boiling down the liquid."
msgstr ""
"Une légende raconte qu’il est possible de\\ncréer une panacée en infusant "
"les feuilles\\nvertes qui poussent sur sa tête."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5676
msgid "TREVENANT"
msgstr "DESSELIANDE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5679
msgid "Elder Tree"
msgstr "Vieillarbre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5682
msgid ""
"Through its roots, it exerts control over\\nother trees. A deadly curse "
"falls upon\\nanyone cutting down trees in forests\\nwhere Trevenant dwell."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à ses racines, il contrôle les arbres\\nde la forêt où il a élu "
"refuge, et maudit\\nquiconque a le malheur de les abattre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5748
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5816
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5883
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5952
msgid "PUMPKABOO"
msgstr "PITROUILLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5751
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5819
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5886
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5955
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6022
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6087
msgid "Pumpkin"
msgstr "Citrouille"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5754
msgid ""
"The light that streams out from\\nthe holes in the pumpkin can\\nhypnotize "
"and control the people and\\nPokémon that see it."
msgstr ""
"La lumière qui filtre par les trous de son\\nventre en forme de citrouille "
"hypnotise et\\nmanipule les humains et les Pokémon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5822
msgid ""
"When taking spirits to the\\nafterlife, small Pumpkaboo prefer the\\nspirits"
" of children to those of adults."
msgstr ""
"Pour guider les âmes dans l’au-delà,\\nles Pitrouille Mini préfèrent "
"celles\\ndes enfants à celles des adultes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5889
msgid ""
"When taking spirits to the\\nafterlife, large Pumpkaboo prefer the\\nspirits"
" of adults to those of children."
msgstr ""
"Pour guider les âmes dans l’au-delà,\\nles Pitrouille Maxi préfèrent "
"celles\\ndes adultes à celles des enfants."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:5958
msgid ""
"Supersized Pumpkaboo are very\\npartial to the spirits of people who\\nwere "
"of similarly superior proportions."
msgstr ""
"Les Pitrouille Ultra ont un faible\\npour les âmes des gens "
"aux\\nproportions tout aussi imposantes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6019
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6084
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6149
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6216
msgid "GOURGEIST"
msgstr "BANSHITROUYE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6025
msgid ""
"Eerie cries emanate from its body\\nin the dead of night. The sounds "
"are\\nsaid to be the wails of spirits who\\nare suffering in the afterlife."
msgstr ""
"Les lugubres lamentations nocturnes de\\nson ventre seraient les cris de "
"souffrance\\nd’âmes en peine, résonnant depuis\\nl’au-delà."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6090
msgid ""
"A small-sized Pumpkaboo evolves\\ninto a small-sized Gourgeist. Its\\nbodily"
" proportions also get passed on\\nto its descendants."
msgstr ""
"Un Pitrouille Mini évolue en\\nBanshitrouye Mini. Ses proportions\\nse "
"transmettent aussi à sa\\ndescendance."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6155
msgid ""
"A large-sized Pumpkaboo evolves\\ninto a large-sized Gourgeist. Its\\nbodily"
" proportions also get passed on\\nto its descendants."
msgstr ""
"Un Pitrouille Maxi évolue en\\nBanshitrouye Maxi. Ses proportions\\nse "
"transmettent aussi à sa\\ndescendance."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6222
msgid ""
"A supersized Pumpkaboo evolves\\ninto a supersized Gourgeist. Its\\nbodily "
"proportions also get passed on to\\nits descendants."
msgstr ""
"Un Pitrouille Ultra évolue en\\nBanshitrouye Ultra. Ses proportions\\nse "
"transmettent aussi à sa\\ndescendance."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6289
msgid "BERGMITE"
msgstr "GRELACON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6292
msgid "Ice Chunk"
msgstr "Glaçon"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6295
msgid ""
"It blocks opponents' attacks with the ice\\nthat shields its body. It uses "
"cold air to\\nrepair any cracks with new ice. They live\\nin herds on snowy "
"mountains."
msgstr ""
"Il bloque les attaques avec la glace qui le\\nprotège et répare ses fissures"
" à l’air\\nfroid. Il vit en troupeau dans les\\nmontagnes enneigées."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6364
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6437
msgid "AVALUGG"
msgstr "SERACRAWL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6370
msgid ""
"The way several Bergmite huddle on its\\nback make it look like an aircraft "
"carrier\\nmade of ice. Its cumbersome frame crushes\\nanything that stands "
"in its way."
msgstr ""
"Avec les Grelaçon blottis sur son dos, il\\nressemble à un porte-avions de "
"glace. Son\\ncorps massif écrase tout sur son passage."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6435
msgid "AVALUGG-H"
msgstr "SERACRAWL-H"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6448
msgid ""
"The armor of ice covering its lower\\njaw puts steel to shame and "
"can\\nshatter rocks with ease."
msgstr ""
"L’armure de glace de sa mâchoire\\ninférieure est plus dure que l’acier\\net"
" brise les rochers sans peine."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6521
msgid "NOIBAT"
msgstr "SONISTRELLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6524
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6600
msgid "Sound Wave"
msgstr "Ondes"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6527
msgid ""
"They live in pitch-black caves. Even a\\nrobust wrestler will become dizzy "
"and\\nunable to stand when exposed to its\\n200,000-hertz ultrasonic waves."
msgstr ""
"Il vit dans des grottes obscures. Ses\\nultrasons de 200000 Hz font "
"chanceler\\nmême le plus robuste des lutteurs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6597
msgid "NOIVERN"
msgstr "BRUYVERNE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6603
msgid ""
"They fly around on moonless nights and\\nattack careless prey. The "
"ultrasonic\\nwaves it emits from its ears can reduce\\na large boulder to "
"pebbles."
msgstr ""
"Les nuits sans lune, il fond sur les proies\\nimprudentes. Les ultrasons de "
"ses oreilles\\nréduisent un gros rocher en cailloux."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6665
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6729
msgid "XERNEAS"
msgstr "XERNEAS"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel (adapté)
#. lot : C1_restes
#. preuve : 288:97 — VIE
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Existence
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6668
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6732
msgid "Life"
msgstr "Vie"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6795
msgid "YVELTAL"
msgstr "YVELTAL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6798
msgid "Destruction"
msgstr "Annihilation"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6801
msgid ""
"When its life comes to an end, its wings\\nand tail spread wide and glow "
"red, and\\nit absorbs the life energy of every living\\nthing and turns into"
" a cocoon."
msgstr ""
"Quand sa vie s’achève, il déploie ses ailes\\nrougeoyantes, absorbe "
"l’énergie vitale de\\ntous les êtres vivants et devient un\\ncocon."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6870
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6935
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7000
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7065
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7130
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7205
msgid "ZYGARDE"
msgstr "ZYGARDE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6873
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:6938
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7003
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7068
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7133
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7212
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Equilibre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7136
msgid ""
"This is Zygarde's perfected form.\\nFrom the orifice on its chest, "
"it\\nradiates high-powered energy that\\neliminates everything."
msgstr ""
"Voici la forme parfaite de Zygarde.\\nL’orifice de son torse libère "
"une\\nénergie colossale qui anéantit\\ntout sur son passage."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7215
msgid ""
"In response to people's emotions\\nduring an unprecedented crisis,\\nZygarde"
" Mega Evolves and calms the\\nsituation with its unmatched power."
msgstr ""
"Face à une crise sans précédent, ZY\\nGARDE répond aux émotions des "
"gens\\let méga-évolue. Sa puissance\\linégalée apaise la situation."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7269
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7343
msgid "DIANCIE"
msgstr "DIANCIE"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Mutation soudaine de Strassie, son corps\nrose
#. et scintillant serait le plus beau du\nmonde. Il crée des diamants entre
#. ses\nmains.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7275
msgid ""
"A sudden transformation of Carbink,\\nits pink, glimmering body is said to "
"be\\nthe loveliest sight in the whole world.\\nIt creates diamonds between "
"its hands."
msgstr ""
"Mutation soudaine de STRASSIE, son corps\\nrose et scintillant serait le "
"plus beau du\\nmonde. Il crée des diamants entre ses\\nmains."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7353
msgid ""
"The impurities upon its body's surface\\nhave fallen away, sparkling so "
"brilliantly\\nthat cannot be observed directly.\\nIt is known as “the Royal "
"Pink Princess”."
msgstr ""
"Les impuretés à la surface de son corps\\nsont tombées. Il brille si fort "
"qu’on ne\\npeut le regarder en face. On l’appelle “la\\nPrincesse Rose "
"Royale”."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7422
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7501
msgid "HOOPA"
msgstr "HOOPA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7425
msgid "Mischief"
msgstr "Chenapan"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7428
msgid ""
"In its true form, it possess a huge amount\\nof power. When its powers are "
"sealed away,\\nit is transformed into a much smaller form.\\nIt teleports "
"things to a secret place."
msgstr ""
"Sous sa vraie forme, il possède une immense\\npuissance. Scellée, elle le "
"réduit à une\\nforme bien plus petite. Il téléporte les\\nobjets."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7504
msgid "Djinn"
msgstr "Chenapan"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7507
msgid ""
"It is the true form of Hoopa, which has had\\nits power sealed away. The "
"rings it carries\\nhave the power to bend dimensions and are\\nable to seize"
" anything in the world."
msgstr ""
"C’est la vraie forme de Hoopa, dont\\nla puissance a été scellée. "
"Ses\\nanneaux peuvent tordre l’espace et\\ns’emparer de tout ce qui existe."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7576
msgid "VOLCANION"
msgstr "VOLCANION"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7579
msgid "Steam"
msgstr "Vapeur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_6_families.h:7582
msgid ""
"It lets out billows of steam from the arms\\non its back and disappears into"
" the dense\\nfog. It's said to live in mountains where\\nhumans do not "
"tread."
msgstr ""
"Il disparaît dans un épais brouillard en\\nlibérant de la vapeur par les "
"bras de son\\ndos. Il vivrait dans des montagnes\\ninaccessibles."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:26
msgid "ROWLET"
msgstr "BRINDIBOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:29
msgid "Grass Quill"
msgstr "Plumefeuille"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:32
msgid ""
"This wary Pokémon uses photosynthesis\\nto store up energy during the day, "
"while\\nbecoming active at night. Silently it\\nglides, drawing near to its "
"target."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon prudent fait le plein d’énergie\\nle jour par photosynthèse et "
"s’active la\\nnuit. Il plane sans bruit jusqu’à sa cible."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:96
msgid "DARTRIX"
msgstr "EFFLECHE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:99
msgid "Blade Quill"
msgstr "Plum’acérée"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:102
msgid ""
"A bit of a dandy, it spends its free time\\npreening its wings. Its "
"preoccupation\\nwith any dirt on its plumage can leave\\nit unable to "
"battle."
msgstr ""
"Légèrement vaniteux, il aime prendre soin\\nde ses ailes. Il refuse parfois "
"de se battre\\nsi ses plumes sont trop sales."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:167
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:238
msgid "DECIDUEYE"
msgstr "ARCHEDUC"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:170
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:246
msgid "Arrow Quill"
msgstr "Plumeflèche"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Archéduc est calme et prudent. Ses\nplumes-
#. flèches sont si précises qu’elles\ntranspercent un caillou à plus de
#. cent\nmètres.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:173
msgid ""
"Decidueye is cool and cautious.\\nIt fires arrow quills from its wings "
"with\\nsuch precision, they can pierce a pebble\\nat distances of over a "
"hundred yards."
msgstr ""
"ARCHEDUC est calme et prudent. Ses\\nplumes-flèches sont si précises "
"qu’elles\\ntranspercent un caillou à plus de cent\\nmètres."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:236
msgid "DECIDUEYE-H"
msgstr "ARCHEDUC-H"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:249
msgid ""
"The air stored inside the rachises\\nof Decidueye's feathers insulates\\nthe"
" Pokémon against Hisui's extreme\\ncold."
msgstr ""
"L’air contenu dans les rachis de ses\\nplumes isole Archéduc du "
"froid\\nextrême de Hisui."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:316
msgid "LITTEN"
msgstr "FLAMIAOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:319
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:384
msgid "Fire Cat"
msgstr "Chat Feu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:322
msgid ""
"While grooming itself, it builds up fur\\ninside its stomach. It sets the "
"fur alight\\nand spews fiery attacks, which change\\nbased on how it coughs."
msgstr ""
"Les poils qu’il avale pendant sa toilette\\nbrûlent dans son ventre. La "
"flamme change\\nselon la façon dont il la recrache."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:381
msgid "TORRACAT"
msgstr "MATOUFEU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:387
msgid ""
"At its throat, it bears a bell of fire. The\\nbell rings brightly whenever "
"this Pokémon\\nspits fire. With a single punch, it can bend\\nan iron bar "
"right over."
msgstr ""
"Une clochette de feu orne sa gorge et\\ntinte quand il crache des flammes. "
"D’un seul\\ncoup de poing, il peut tordre une barre de\\nfer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:445
msgid "INCINEROAR"
msgstr "FELINFERNO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:448
msgid "Heel"
msgstr "Vil Catcheur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:451
msgid ""
"This Pokémon has a violent, selfish\\ndisposition. If it's not in the mood "
"to\\nlisten, it will ignore its Trainer's orders\\nwith complete "
"nonchalance."
msgstr ""
"Un Pokémon brutal qui n’en fait qu’à sa\\ntête. Selon son humeur, il lui "
"arrive\\nd’ignorer sciemment les ordres de son\\nDresseur."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:510
msgid "POPPLIO"
msgstr "OTAQUIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:516
msgid ""
"This Pokémon snorts body fluids from\\nits nose, blowing balloons to smash "
"into\\nits foes. It practices diligently so it can\\nlearn to make big "
"bubbles."
msgstr ""
"Il souffle des bulles par le nez pour les\\nfaire éclater sur ses ennemis. "
"Il\\ns’entraîne dur pour apprendre à en faire de\\ngrosses."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:575
msgid "BRIONNE"
msgstr "OTARLETTE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:578
msgid "Pop Star"
msgstr "Starlette"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:581
msgid ""
"It cares deeply for its companions.\\nWhen its Trainer is feeling down, "
"it\\nperforms a cheery dance with a sequence\\nof water balloons  to try and"
" help."
msgstr ""
"Il tient beaucoup à ses amis. Quand son\\nDresseur a le cafard, il exécute "
"une danse\\njoyeuse avec ses ballons d’eau pour le\\nconsoler."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:639
msgid "PRIMARINA"
msgstr "ORATORIA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:642
msgid "Soloist"
msgstr "Soliste"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:645
msgid ""
"It controls its water balloons with song.\\nThe melody is learned from "
"others of\\nits kind and is passed down from one\\ngeneration to the next."
msgstr ""
"Il contrôle ses ballons d’eau par son\\nchant, dont la mélodie, apprise "
"auprès de\\nses semblables, se transmet de génération\\nen génération."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:705
msgid "PIKIPEK"
msgstr "PICASSAUT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:708
msgid "Woodpecker"
msgstr "Pivert"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:711
msgid ""
"This Pokémon feeds on berries, whose\\nleftover seeds become the ammunition "
"for\\nthe attacks it fires off from its mouth.\\nIt uses holes in trees for "
"nesting."
msgstr ""
"Il se nourrit de Baies dont il crache les\\ngraines comme des projectiles. "
"Il fait son\\nnid dans le creux des arbres."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:776
msgid "TRUMBEAK"
msgstr "PICLAIRON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:779
msgid "Bugle Beak"
msgstr "Bec Clairon"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:782
msgid ""
"By bending its beak, it can produce a\\nvariety of calls and brand itself a "
"noisy\\nnuisance for its neighbors. It eats\\nberries and stores their seeds"
" in its beak."
msgstr ""
"Il plie son bec pour pousser toutes sortes\\nde cris, au grand dam de ses "
"voisins. Il\\nrange dans son bec les graines des Baies\\nqu’il mange."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:846
msgid "TOUCANNON"
msgstr "BAZOUCAN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:849
msgid "Cannon"
msgstr "Canon"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:852
msgid ""
"When it battles, within its beak, its\\ninternal gases ignite, "
"explosively\\nlaunching seeds with enough power to\\npulverize boulders."
msgstr ""
"En combat, les gaz de son bec s’enflamment\\net propulsent des graines "
"assez\\npuissantes pour pulvériser des rochers."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:915
msgid "YUNGOOS"
msgstr "MANGLOUTON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:918
msgid "Loitering"
msgstr "Patrouille"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:921
msgid ""
"With its sharp fangs, it will bite anything.\\nIt wanders around in a never-"
"ending\\nsearch for food. At dusk, it collapses\\nand falls asleep on the "
"spot."
msgstr ""
"Il erre sans fin en quête de nourriture et\\nmord tout avec ses crocs "
"acérés. Au\\ncrépuscule, il s’effondre et s’endort sur\\nplace."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:981
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1043
msgid "GUMSHOOS"
msgstr "ARGOUSTE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:984
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1046
msgid "Stakeout"
msgstr "Filature"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1108
msgid "GRUBBIN"
msgstr "LARVIBULE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1111
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1201
msgid "Larva"
msgstr "Larve"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1114
msgid ""
"They often gather near places frequented\\nby electric Pokémon in order to "
"avoid being\\nattacked by bird Pokémon, though it\\nnormally lives "
"underground."
msgstr ""
"Il vit d’ordinaire sous terre, mais se\\nrassemble souvent près des "
"Pokémon\\nElectrik pour échapper aux Pokémon\\noiseaux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1174
msgid "CHARJABUG"
msgstr "CHRYSAPILE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1177
msgid "Battery"
msgstr "Batterie"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1180
msgid ""
"From the food it digests, it generates\\nelectricity, and it stores this "
"energy in\\nits electric sac. On camping trips, people\\nare grateful to "
"have one around."
msgstr ""
"Il produit de l’électricité à partir de sa\\nnourriture et la stocke dans sa"
" poche\\nélectrique. En camping, on est bien content\\nd’en avoir un."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1244
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1305
msgid "VIKAVOLT"
msgstr "LUCANON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1380
msgid "CRABRAWLER"
msgstr "CRABAGARRE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1383
msgid "Boxing"
msgstr "Boxeur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1386
msgid ""
"While guarding its weak points with its\\npincers, it looks for an opening "
"and\\nunleashes punches. When it loses, it\\nfoams at the mouth and faints."
msgstr ""
"Il protège ses points faibles avec ses\\npinces en guettant le moment "
"propice pour\\nriposter. Il crache de l’écume lorsqu’il\\ntombe K.O."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1447
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1514
msgid "CRABOMINABLE"
msgstr "CRABOMINABLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1450
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1521
msgid "Woolly Crab"
msgstr "Crabe Velu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1453
msgid ""
"It aimed for the top but got lost and\\nended up on a snowy mountain. Being "
"forced\\nto endure the cold, this Pokémon evolved\\nand grew thick fur."
msgstr ""
"Il visait le sommet, mais s’est perdu sur\\nune montagne enneigée. Forcé "
"d’endurer le\\nfroid, il a évolué et s’est couvert d’une\\népaisse fourrure."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1524
msgid ""
"It can pulverize reinforced concrete with\\na light swing of one of its "
"fists, each of\\nwhich is covered in a thick layer of ice."
msgstr ""
"Il peut pulvériser du béton armé d’un\\nléger coup de poing. Chacun de ses "
"poings\\nest couvert d’une épaisse couche de\\nglace."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1575
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1643
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1711
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1779
msgid "ORICORIO"
msgstr "PLUMELINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1581
msgid ""
"It wins the hearts of its enemies\\nwith its passionate dancing and "
"then\\nuses the opening it creates to\\nburn them up with blazing flames."
msgstr ""
"Il envoûte ses ennemis avec une danse\\nfougueuse, et profite de leur "
"inattention\\npour les noyer sous un torrent de flammes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1649
msgid ""
"This form of Oricorio has sipped\\nyellow nectar. It uses nimble steps "
"to\\napproach opponents, then knocks\\nthem out with electric punches."
msgstr ""
"Ce Plumeline a bu du nectar jaune.\\nIl approche l’ennemi à pas "
"agiles,\\npuis l’assomme de coups de poing\\nélectriques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1717
msgid ""
"This form of Oricorio has sipped\\npink nectar. It elevates its mind "
"with\\nthe gentle steps of its dance, then\\nunleashes its psychic energy."
msgstr ""
"Ce Plumeline a bu du nectar rose.\\nIl élève son esprit par les pas "
"doux\\nde sa danse, puis libère son\\nénergie psychique."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1785
msgid ""
"It charms its opponents with its\\nrefined dancing. When they let "
"their\\nguard down, it places a curse on\\nthem that will bring on their "
"demise."
msgstr ""
"Il charme l’ennemi par sa danse\\nraffinée. Dès que celui-ci baisse "
"sa\\ngarde, il lui jette une malédiction\\nqui causera sa perte."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1849
msgid "CUTIEFLY"
msgstr "BOMBYDOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1852
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1952
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2014
msgid "Bee Fly"
msgstr "Bombyle"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Des nuées de Bombydou volettent\nau-dessus des
#. gens dont l’aura ressemble à\ncelle des fleurs. Il sait quelles
#. fleurs\nvont bientôt éclore.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1855
msgid ""
"Myriads of Cutiefly flutter above the\\nheads of people who have auras "
"resembling\\nthose of flowers. It can identify which\\nflowers are about to "
"bloom."
msgstr ""
"Des nuées de BOMBYDOU volettent\\nau-dessus des gens dont l’aura ressemble "
"à\\ncelle des fleurs. Il sait quelles fleurs\\nvont bientôt éclore."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:1949
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2011
msgid "RIBOMBEE"
msgstr "RUBOMBELLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2077
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2141
msgid "ROCKRUFF"
msgstr "ROCABOT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2204
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2272
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2340
msgid "LYCANROC"
msgstr "LOUGAROC"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2207
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2275
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2343
msgid "Wolf"
msgstr "Loup"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2210
msgid ""
"It has a calm and collected\\ndemeanor. It swiftly closes in on its "
"prey,\\nthen slices them with the rocks in\\nits mane."
msgstr ""
"Il est d’un naturel calme et posé. Il fond\\nsur sa proie et la tranche avec"
" les roches\\nde sa crinière."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2278
msgid ""
"This Pokémon uses its rocky mane\\nto slash any who approach. It will\\neven"
" disobey its Trainer if it dislikes\\nthe orders it was given."
msgstr ""
"Il lacère quiconque approche avec sa\\ncrinière rocheuse. Il désobéit "
"même\\nà son Dresseur si les ordres\\nne lui plaisent pas."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2346
msgid ""
"These Pokémon have both calm and\\nferocious qualities. It's said "
"that\\nthis form of Lycanroc is the most\\ntroublesome to raise."
msgstr ""
"Ces Pokémon sont à la fois calmes et\\nféroces. On dit que cette forme "
"de\\nLougaroc est la plus difficile\\nà élever."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2410
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2478
msgid "WISHIWASHI"
msgstr "FROUSSARDINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2413
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2481
msgid "Small Fry"
msgstr "Minipoisson"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2416
msgid ""
"Individually, they're incredibly\\nweak. It's by gathering up into\\nschools"
" that they're able to confront\\nopponents."
msgstr ""
"Individuellement, ils sont très faibles. Ils\\nont donc développé une "
"tactique de\\ndéplacement en banc pour résister aux\\nennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2484
msgid ""
"When facing tough opponents, they\\nget into formation. But if they "
"get\\nwounded in battle, they'll scatter\\nand become solitary again."
msgstr ""
"Face à un adversaire coriace, ils\\nse mettent en formation. Mais "
"s’ils\\nsont blessés, ils se dispersent et\\nredeviennent solitaires."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2538
msgid "MAREANIE"
msgstr "VORASTERIE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2541
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2607
msgid "Brutal Star"
msgstr "Cruel"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2544
msgid ""
"It's found crawling on beaches and\\nseafloors. The coral that grows "
"on\\nCorsola's head is as good as a five-star\\nbanquet to this Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"Il rampe le long des fonds marins et des\\nplages de sable. Les cornes de "
"corail des\\nCorayon sont ses biscuits apéritifs\\npréférés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2604
msgid "TOXAPEX"
msgstr "PREDASTERIE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2610
msgid ""
"Those attacked by Toxapex's poison will\\nsuffer intense pain for three days"
" and\\nthree nights. Post-recovery, there will be\\nsome aftereffects."
msgstr ""
"Son poison provoque chez sa victime des\\ndouleurs aiguës pendant trois "
"jours et\\ntrois nuits, et laisse des séquelles\\nirréversibles."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2670
msgid "MUDBRAY"
msgstr "TIBOUDET"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2673
msgid "Donkey"
msgstr "Ane"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2676
msgid ""
"The mud stuck to Mudbray's hooves\\nenhances its grip and its powerful "
"running\\ngait. Eating dirt, making mud, and playing\\nin the mire form its "
"daily routine."
msgstr ""
"La boue collée à ses sabots améliore son\\nadhérence. Manger de la terre, "
"faire de la\\nboue et jouer dans la gadoue: voilà son\\nquotidien."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2736
msgid "MUDSDALE"
msgstr "BOURRINOS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2739
msgid "Draft Horse"
msgstr "Cheval Trait"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2742
msgid ""
"Its heavy, mud-covered kicks are its\\nbest means of attack, and it can "
"reduce\\nlarge trucks to scrap without breaking\\na sweat."
msgstr ""
"C’est le spécialiste du gros coup de sabot\\nboueux. Grâce à cela, il peut "
"facilement\\nréduire un camion entier en un tas de\\nferraille."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2802
msgid "DEWPIDER"
msgstr "ARAQUA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2805
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2878
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2939
msgid "Water Bubble"
msgstr "Aquabulle"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2808
msgid ""
"It crawls onto the land in search of food.\\nWhen it comes across enemies or"
" potential\\nprey, this Pokémon smashes its\\nwater-bubble-covered head into"
" them."
msgstr ""
"Il rampe sur la terre ferme pour se nourrir.\\nFace à un ennemi ou une "
"proie, il lui assène\\nun coup de sa tête couverte d’une bulle\\nd’eau."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2875
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:2936
msgid "ARAQUANID"
msgstr "TARENBULLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3002
msgid "FOMANTIS"
msgstr "MIMANTIS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3005
msgid "Sickle Grass"
msgstr "Fauch’Herbe"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3008
msgid ""
"During the day, it sleeps and soaks up\\nlight. They give off a sweet and "
"refreshing\\nscent. Cutiefly often gather near the tall\\ngrass where "
"Fomantis are hiding."
msgstr ""
"Le jour, il dort en absorbant la lumière et\\ndégage un doux parfum. Les "
"Bombydou se\\nrassemblent près des hautes herbes où se\\ncachent les "
"Mimantis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3068
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3133
msgid "LURANTIS"
msgstr "FLORAMANTIS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3071
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3136
msgid "Bloom Sickle"
msgstr "Fauch’Fleur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3200
msgid "MORELULL"
msgstr "SPODODO"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Luminescent
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3203
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3270
msgid "Illuminate"
msgstr "Lumiatirance"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3206
msgid ""
"As it drowses the day away, it nourishes\\nitself by sucking from tree "
"roots.\\nIt wakens at the fall of night, wandering\\noff in search of a new "
"tree."
msgstr ""
"Le jour, il dort en absorbant les\\nnutriments à la racine des arbres. Le "
"soir,\\nil se lève et part à la recherche d’un\\nnouvel arbre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3267
msgid "SHIINOTIC"
msgstr "LAMPIGNON"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Il est risqué de s’aventurer la nuit dans
#. un\nbois peuplé de Lampignon. Attirés par leur\nlumière envoûtante,
#. certains n’en sont\njamais revenus.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3273
msgid ""
"Forests where Shiinotic live are\\ntreacherous to enter at night.\\nPeople "
"confused by its strange lights\\ncan never find their way home again."
msgstr ""
"Il est risqué de s’aventurer la nuit dans un\\nbois peuplé de LAMPIGNON. "
"Attirés par leur\\nlumière envoûtante, certains n’en sont\\njamais revenus."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3333
msgid "SALANDIT"
msgstr "TRITOX"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3336
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3406
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3467
msgid "Toxic Lizard"
msgstr "Toxilézard"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3339
msgid ""
"It burns its bodily fluids to create a\\nsweet-smelling poisonous gas. When "
"its\\nenemies become disoriented from inhaling\\nthe gas, it attacks them."
msgstr ""
"Il brûle ses fluides corporels pour créer\\nun gaz toxique au parfum sucré. "
"Quand ses\\nennemis sont étourdis par ce gaz, il les\\nattaque."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3403
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3464
msgid "SALAZZLE"
msgstr "MALAMANDRE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3529
msgid "STUFFUL"
msgstr "NOUNOURSON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3532
msgid "Flailing"
msgstr "Gigoteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3535
msgid ""
"Despite its adorable appearance, when it\\ngets angry and flails about, its "
"arms and\\nlegs could knock a pro wrestler sprawling.\\nIt's an incredibly "
"dangerous Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"Malgré son air adorable, quand il se fâche\\net se débat, ses bras et ses "
"pattes\\npeuvent mettre au tapis un catcheur. Il\\nest très dangereux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3598
msgid "BEWEAR"
msgstr "CHELOURS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3601
msgid "Strong Arm"
msgstr "Biscoteaux"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3604
msgid ""
"This Pokémon has the habit of hugging its\\ncompanions. Many Trainers have "
"left this\\nworld after their spines were squashed\\nby its hug."
msgstr ""
"Il fête chaque victoire par une accolade\\navec son Dresseur, au grand dam "
"de ce\\ndernier, et en particulier de sa colonne\\nvertébrale."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3668
msgid "BOUNSWEET"
msgstr "CROQUINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Un parfum délicieux émane de son corps.\nDiluée,
#. la sueur de Croquine donne un jus\nparfaitement sucré.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3674
msgid ""
"A delectable aroma pours from its body. \\nBounsweet's sweat can be watered "
"down\\ninto a juice with just the right amount\\nof sweetness."
msgstr ""
"Un parfum délicieux émane\\nde son corps. Diluée, la\\nsueur de CROQUINE "
"donne\\nun jus parfaitement sucré."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3735
msgid "STEENEE"
msgstr "CANDINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3741
msgid ""
"The sepals on its head developed to\\nprotect its body. These are quite "
"hard, so\\neven if pecked by bird Pokémon, this\\nPokémon is totally fine."
msgstr ""
"Pour mieux se défendre, il a fait pousser\\nsur son corps un calice assez "
"solide pour\\nrésister aux coups de bec des Pokémon\\noiseaux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3801
msgid "TSAREENA"
msgstr "SUCREINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3807
msgid ""
"Its long, striking legs aren't just for\\nshow but to be used to kick with "
"skill.\\nIn victory, it shows off by kicking the\\ndefeated, laughing "
"boisterously."
msgstr ""
"Spécialiste du coup de pied bien placé, ce\\nPokémon prend un malin plaisir "
"à savater\\nses ennemis au sol en riant aux éclats."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3868
msgid "COMFEY"
msgstr "GUERILANDE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3871
msgid "Posy Picker"
msgstr "Tressefleur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3874
msgid ""
"It attaches flowers to its nutritious\\nvine. Baths prepared with the "
"flowers\\nfrom its vine have a relaxing effect, so\\nthis Pokémon is a hit "
"with many people."
msgstr ""
"Il accroche des fleurs à sa liane\\nnourrissante. Les bains préparés avec "
"ses\\nfleurs ont un effet relaxant, ce qui le rend\\ntrès populaire."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3935
msgid "ORANGURU"
msgstr "GOUROUTAN"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Grand Sage
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3938
msgid "Sage"
msgstr "Sage"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:3941
msgid ""
"Deep in the jungle, high in the lofty\\ncanopy, this Pokémon abides. On "
"rare\\noccasions, it shows up at the beach to\\nmatch wits with Slowking."
msgstr ""
"Il vit perché dans les arbres au cœur de la\\njungle. Plus rarement, on le "
"croise sur la\\nplage, en plein duel d’intelligence avec un\\nRoigada."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4004
msgid "PASSIMIAN"
msgstr "QUARTERMAC"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4007
msgid "Teamwork"
msgstr "Coopération"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4010
msgid ""
"They battle with hard berries for weapons.\\nThey form groups of about 20 "
"individuals.\\nTheir techniques are passed from the boss\\nto the group, "
"generation upon generation."
msgstr ""
"Ils se battent avec des Baies dures en\\nguise d’armes, en groupes d’une "
"vingtaine.\\nLe chef transmet ses techniques de\\ngénération en génération."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4073
msgid "WIMPOD"
msgstr "SOVKIPOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4076
msgid "Turn Tail"
msgstr "Cavaleur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4079
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is a coward. As it desperately\\ndashes off, the flailing of "
"its many legs\\nleaves a sparkling clean path in its wake.\\nIt lives on "
"beaches and seabeds."
msgstr ""
"C’est un trouillard. Quand il détale, ses\\nnombreuses pattes laissent "
"derrière lui un\\nsillon étincelant de propreté. Il vit sur\\nles plages."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4142
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4212
msgid "GOLISOPOD"
msgstr "SARMURAI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4145
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4219
msgid "Hard Scale"
msgstr "Blindé"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4148
msgid ""
"It battles skillfully with its six arms,\\nwith a flashing slash of its "
"giant sharp\\nclaws, it cleaves seawater--or even\\nair--right in two."
msgstr ""
"Il se bat avec habileté grâce à ses six\\nbras. D’un éclair de ses griffes "
"géantes, il\\nfend l’eau de mer, et même l’air, en deux."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4222
msgid ""
"It uses four of its arms to fiercely\\nassail its foes. Once they've been "
"pushed\\nto the brink of defeat, it finishes them\\noff with the arms it "
"kept hidden."
msgstr ""
"Il assaille ses ennemis avec quatre de\\nses bras. Une fois qu’ils sont au "
"bord de\\nla défaite, il les achève avec les bras\\nqu’il tenait cachés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4274
msgid "SANDYGAST"
msgstr "BACABOUH"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4277
msgid "Sand Heap"
msgstr "Pâtéd’Sable"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4280
msgid ""
"It takes control of anyone who puts a\\nhand in its mouth, to add to the "
"pile\\nof its sand-mound body. This Pokémon\\nembodies the grudges of the "
"departed."
msgstr ""
"Il contrôle quiconque met la main dans sa\\nbouche pour grossir son tas de "
"sable. Ce\\nPokémon incarne la rancune des défunts."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4340
msgid "PALOSSAND"
msgstr "TREPASSABLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4343
msgid "Sand Castle"
msgstr "Châtod’Sable"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4346
msgid ""
"Possessed people controlled by this\\nPokémon transformed its sand mound "
"into\\na castle. As it evolved, its power to curse\\ngrew ever stronger."
msgstr ""
"Il a possédé un humain pour que ce dernier\\nle remodèle en château de "
"sable, décuplant\\nau passage ses pouvoirs de malédiction."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4405
msgid "PYUKUMUKU"
msgstr "CONCOMBAFFE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4408
msgid "Sea Cucumber"
msgstr "Holothurie"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4411
msgid ""
"It lives in shallow seas, such as areas\\nnear a beach. The sticky mucous "
"that\\ncovers their bodies can be used to soothe\\nsunburned skin. How "
"convenient!"
msgstr ""
"Il vit en eaux peu profondes, près des\\nplages. Le mucus collant qui le "
"recouvre\\napaise les coups de soleil. Bien pratique!"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4476
msgid "TYPE: NULL"
msgstr "TYPE:0"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4479
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4545
msgid "Synthetic"
msgstr "Multigénome"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4482
msgid ""
"Due to the danger that this synthetic\\nPokémon may go on a rampage, it "
"wears a\\ncontrol mask to restrain its capabilities.\\nIt has some hidden "
"special power."
msgstr ""
"Comme ce Pokémon synthétique risque de se\\ndéchaîner, on lui a mis un "
"masque qui bride\\nses capacités. Il recèle un pouvoir secret."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4542
msgid "SILVALLY"
msgstr "SILVALLIE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4626
msgid "MINIOR"
msgstr "METENO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4629
msgid "Meteor"
msgstr "Météore"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4747
msgid "KOMALA"
msgstr "DODOALA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4753
msgid ""
"It is born asleep, and it dies asleep.\\nAll its movements are apparently no"
" more\\nthan the results of it tossing and turning\\nin its dreams."
msgstr ""
"Il rejoint et quitte ce monde en dormant.\\nSon existence se déroule comme "
"un rêve\\npaisible. Il dort du sommeil du juste toute\\nsa vie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4814
msgid "TURTONATOR"
msgstr "BOUMATA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4817
msgid "Blast Turtle"
msgstr "Tortue Boum"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4820
msgid ""
"The shell on its back is chemically\\nunstable and explodes violently if "
"struck.\\nThe hole in its stomach is its weak point.\\nIt gushes fire from "
"its nostrils."
msgstr ""
"La carapace de son dos est instable et\\nexplose violemment si on la frappe."
" Son\\npoint faible est le trou de son ventre. Il\\ncrache du feu par le "
"nez."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4885
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4947
msgid "TOGEDEMARU"
msgstr "TOGEDEMARU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4888
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:4950
msgid "Roly-Poly"
msgstr "Roulenboule"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5014
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5077
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5132
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5198
msgid "MIMIKYU"
msgstr "MIMIQUI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5017
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5080
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5135
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5201
msgid "Disguise"
msgstr "Fantômasque"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5257
msgid "BRUXISH"
msgstr "DENTICRISSE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5260
msgid "Gnash Teeth"
msgstr "Grincedent"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Il paralyse ses proies avec ses
#. pouvoirs\npsychiques, puis les broie avec ses dents\npuissantes. Même la
#. coquille d’un Kokiyas\nne lui résiste pas.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5263
msgid ""
"It stuns its prey with its psychic powers\\nand then grinds them to mush "
"with its\\nstrong teeth. Even Shellder's shell is no\\nmatch for it."
msgstr ""
"Il paralyse ses proies avec ses pouvoirs\\npsychiques, puis les broie avec "
"ses dents\\npuissantes. Même la coquille d’un KOKIYAS\\nne lui résiste pas."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5324
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5395
msgid "DRAMPA"
msgstr "DRAIEUL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5327
msgid "Placid"
msgstr "Nonchalant"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5330
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is friendly to people and\\nloves children most of all. It "
"comes from\\ndeep in the mountains to play with\\nchildren it likes in town."
msgstr ""
"Il adore les enfants rieurs. Il n’hésite pas\\nà descendre de sa montagne "
"pour venir en\\nville jouer avec ses petits amis."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5402
msgid "Imposing"
msgstr "Imposant"

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5405
msgid ""
"Drampa's cells have been\\ninvigorated, allowing it to regain\\nits youth. "
"It manipulates the\\natmosphere to summon storms."
msgstr ""
"Les cellules de DRAIEUL ont été\\nrevigorées, ce qui lui a rendu "
"sa\\njeunesse. Il manipule l’atmosphère\\npour invoquer des tempêtes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5458
msgid "DHELMISE"
msgstr "SINISTRAIL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5461
msgid "Sea Creeper"
msgstr "Varech"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5464
msgid ""
"The soul of seaweed adrift in the waves\\nbecame reborn as this "
"Pokémon.\\nIt maintains itself with new infusions of\\nseabed detritus and "
"seaweed."
msgstr ""
"C’est une réincarnation de l’âme des\\nalgues. Son corps est formé de "
"détritus\\nmarins qu’il enveloppe de limon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5525
msgid "JANGMO-O"
msgstr "BEBECAILLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5528
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5597
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5665
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5726
msgid "Scaly"
msgstr "Ecailles"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5531
msgid ""
"It expresses its feelings by smacking its\\nscales. Metallic sounds echo "
"through the\\ntall mountains where Jangmo-o live. They\\ngrow little by "
"little battling one another."
msgstr ""
"Il exprime ses émotions en frappant ses\\nécailles. Des sons métalliques "
"résonnent\\ndans les montagnes où les Bébécaille\\ngrandissent en se "
"battant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5594
msgid "HAKAMO-O"
msgstr "ECAID"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5600
msgid ""
"It sheds and regrows its scales on a\\ncontinuous basis. The scales "
"become\\nharder each time they're regrown. Its\\nscaly punches tear its foes"
" to shreds."
msgstr ""
"Il perd et refait ses écailles en\\npermanence. Elles durcissent à "
"chaque\\nrepousse. Ses coups de poing écailleux\\ntaillent ses ennemis en "
"pièces."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5662
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5723
msgid "KOMMO-O"
msgstr "EKAISER"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5795
msgid "TAPU KOKO"
msgstr "TOKORICO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5798
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5875
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5948
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6023
msgid "Land Spirit"
msgstr "Tutélaire"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5801
msgid ""
"It confuses its enemies by flying too\\nquickly for the eye to follow. It "
"has a\\nhair-trigger temper but forgets what\\nmade it angry an instant "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Il déstabilise ses ennemis avec sa vitesse\\nébouriffante. Il pique souvent "
"des colères\\nnoires, mais il en oublie aussitôt la raison."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5872
msgid "TAPU LELE"
msgstr "TOKOPIYON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5878
msgid ""
"A fragrant aroma of flowers follows it.\\nAs it flutters about, it scatters "
"its\\nstrangely glowing scales. Touching them\\nis said to restore good "
"health."
msgstr ""
"Un doux parfum de fleurs le suit. En\\nvoletant, il répand ses "
"écailles\\nétrangement lumineuses. Les toucher\\nrendrait la santé."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5945
msgid "TAPU BULU"
msgstr "TOKOTORO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:5951
msgid ""
"It causes vegetation to grow, and then\\nit absorbs energy from the "
"growth.\\nIt pulls large trees up by the roots and\\nswings them around at "
"its enemies."
msgstr ""
"Il fait pousser la végétation et absorbe\\nl’énergie de sa croissance. Il "
"déracine de\\ngrands arbres et les fait tournoyer contre\\nses ennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6020
msgid "TAPU FINI"
msgstr "TOKOPISCO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6026
msgid ""
"People say it can create pure water that\\nwill wash away any corruption. "
"The dense\\nfog it creates brings the downfall and\\ndestruction of its "
"confused enemies."
msgstr ""
"On dit qu’il crée une eau pure capable de\\nlaver toute souillure. Son épais"
" brouillard\\négare ses ennemis et cause leur perte."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6093
msgid "COSMOG"
msgstr "COSMOG"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6096
msgid "Nebula"
msgstr "Nébuleuse"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6099
msgid ""
"In ages past, it was called the child of\\nthe stars. It's said to be a "
"Pokémon from\\nanother world, but no specific details\\nare known."
msgstr ""
"Jadis, on l’appelait l’enfant des étoiles. On\\nraconte qu’il viendrait d’un"
" autre monde,\\nmais rien n’est prouvé."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6163
msgid "COSMOEM"
msgstr "COSMOVUM"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6166
msgid "Protostar"
msgstr "Proto-Etoile"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6169
msgid ""
"Motionless as if dead, its body is faintly\\nwarm to the touch. There's "
"something\\naccumulating around the black core\\nwithin its hard shell."
msgstr ""
"Immobile comme s’il était mort, son corps\\nest pourtant tiède. Quelque "
"chose\\ns’accumule autour du noyau noir de sa\\ncoque."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6233
msgid "SOLGALEO"
msgstr "SOLGALEO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6236
msgid "Sunne"
msgstr "Halo Solaire"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6239
msgid ""
"It is said to live in another world.\\nThe intense light it radiates from "
"the\\nsurface of its body can make the darkest\\nof nights light up like "
"midday."
msgstr ""
"Il viendrait d’un autre monde. Tout son\\ncorps émet une puissante lumière "
"qui peut\\nchanger la nuit la plus noire en un jour\\nradieux."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6299
msgid "LUNALA"
msgstr "LUNALA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6302
msgid "Moone"
msgstr "Halo Lunaire"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6305
msgid ""
"When its third eye activates, away it flies\\nto another world. This Pokémon"
" devours\\nlight, drawing the moonless dark veil of\\nnight over the "
"brightness of day."
msgstr ""
"Quand son troisième œil s’active, il\\ns’envole vers un autre monde. Il "
"dévore la\\nlumière et drape le jour d’un voile de nuit\\nsans lune."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6368
msgid "NIHILEGO"
msgstr "ZEROID"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6371
msgid "Parasite"
msgstr "Parasite"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6374
msgid ""
"One of several mysterious Ultra Beasts.\\nIt's unclear whether or not this "
"Pokémon\\nis sentient, but sometimes it can be\\nobserved behaving like a "
"young girl."
msgstr ""
"Une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères. On\\nignore si elle est douée de "
"conscience,\\nmais elle se comporte parfois comme une\\njeune fille."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6437
msgid "BUZZWOLE"
msgstr "MOUSCOTO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6440
msgid "Swollen"
msgstr "Enflé"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6443
msgid ""
"This life-form called an Ultra Beast\\nappeared from another world. It "
"shows\\noff its body, but whether that display\\nis a boast or a threat "
"remains unclear."
msgstr ""
"Cette Ultra-Chimère venue d’un autre\\nmonde exhibe son corps, mais nul ne "
"sait si\\nc’est pour frimer ou pour menacer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6504
msgid "PHEROMOSA"
msgstr "CANCRELOVE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6507
msgid "Lissome"
msgstr "Gracile"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6510
msgid ""
"One of the dangerous Ultra Beasts,\\nit refuses to touch anything, "
"perhaps\\nbecause it senses some uncleanness\\nin this world."
msgstr ""
"Cette dangereuse Ultra-Chimère refuse de\\ntoucher quoi que ce soit, sans "
"doute parce\\nqu’elle juge notre monde impur."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6571
msgid "XURKITREE"
msgstr "CABLIFERE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6574
msgid "Glowing"
msgstr "Luminaire"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6577
msgid ""
"One of the mysterious life-forms known\\nas Ultra Beasts. Astonishing "
"electric\\nshocks emanate from its entire body,\\naccording to witnesses."
msgstr ""
"L’une des mystérieuses Ultra-Chimères. On\\nl’aurait vue émettre une "
"formidable\\nquantité d’électricité autour d’elle."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6640
msgid "CELESTEELA"
msgstr "BAMBOISELLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6643
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "Décollage"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6646
msgid ""
"It appeared from the Ultra Wormhole.\\nOne kind of Ultra Beast, witnesses "
"saw\\nit flying across the sky by expelling gas\\nfrom its two arms."
msgstr ""
"Il est sorti de l’Ultra-Brèche. Selon des\\ntémoins, cette Ultra-Chimère "
"vole dans le\\nciel en expulsant du gaz de ses deux bras."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6707
msgid "KARTANA"
msgstr "KATAGAMI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6710
msgid "Drawn Sword"
msgstr "Battô"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6713
msgid ""
"This Ultra Beast came from the\\nUltra Wormhole. It seems not to "
"attack\\nenemies on its own, but its sharp body is\\na dangerous weapon in "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Une Ultra-Chimère venue de l’Ultra-Brèche.\\nElle ne semble pas agressive, "
"bien que son\\ncorps tout entier soit une arme\\ntranchante."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6775
msgid "GUZZLORD"
msgstr "ENGLOUTYRAN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6778
msgid "Junkivore"
msgstr "Bizarrovore"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6781
msgid ""
"A dangerous Ultra Beast, it has gobbled\\nmountains and swallowed whole "
"buildings,\\naccording to reports. But for some reason\\nits droppings have "
"never been found."
msgstr ""
"Une Ultra-Chimère dangereuse qui aurait\\nenglouti des montagnes et avalé "
"des\\nimmeubles entiers. Pourtant, on n’a jamais\\ntrouvé ses excréments."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6844
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6914
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6985
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7060
msgid "NECROZMA"
msgstr "NECROZMA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6847
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6917
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6988
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7063
msgid "Prism"
msgstr "Prisme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6850
msgid ""
"Reminiscent of the Ultra Beasts, this\\nlife-form, apparently asleep "
"underground,\\nis thought to have come from another\\nworld in ancient "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Une créature endormie sous terre. On\\nsuppose qu’il s’agit d’une Ultra-"
"Chimère\\nvenue d’un autre monde il y a bien\\nlongtemps."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6920
msgid ""
"This is its form while it is devouring\\nthe light of Solgaleo. It pounces "
"on\\nfoes and then slashes them with the\\nclaws on its four limbs and back."
msgstr ""
"C’est sa forme quand il dévore la\\nlumière de SOLGALEO. Il bondit sur "
"ses\\nennemis et les lacère avec les griffes\\nde ses quatre pattes et de "
"son dos."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:6991
msgid ""
"This is its form while it's\\ndevouring the light of Lunala. It "
"grasps\\nfoes in its giant claws and rips them\\napart with brute force."
msgstr ""
"C’est sa forme quand il dévore la lumière\\nde LUNALA. Il saisit ses ennemis"
" dans\\nses griffes géantes et les déchire par\\nla force brute."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7066
msgid ""
"The light pouring out from all over\\nits body affects living things "
"and\\nnature, impacting them in various\\nways."
msgstr ""
"La lumière qui jaillit de tout son\\ncorps affecte les êtres vivants et "
"la\\nnature, et les influence de diverses\\nfaçons."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7138
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7207
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7277
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7337
msgid "MAGEARNA"
msgstr "MAGEARNA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7141
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7210
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7284
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7344
msgid "Artificial"
msgstr "Artificiel"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7144
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7287
msgid ""
"This artificial Pokémon, constructed more\\nthan 500 years ago, can "
"understand human\\nspeech but cannot itself speak. Its true\\nself is its "
"Soul-Heart, an artificial soul."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon artificiel créé il y a plus de\\n500 ans comprend les humains, "
"mais ne parle\\npas. Son vrai moi est l’Animacœur, une âme\\nartificielle."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7213
msgid ""
"This is its form from almost 500\\nyears ago. Its body is nothing "
"more\\nthan a container-its artificial heart\\nis the actual life-form."
msgstr ""
"Voici sa forme d’il y a près de 500\\nans. Son corps n’est qu’un "
"récipient:\\nson cœur artificiel est le véritable\\nêtre vivant."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7347
msgid ""
"A mechanism to remove Magearna's\\nlimitations has lain secretly "
"within\\nMagearna for 500 years. This mechanism\\nis triggered by a Mega "
"Stone."
msgstr ""
"Un mécanisme qui lève les limites de\\nMAGEARNA y est caché depuis 500 "
"ans.\\nCe mécanisme est déclenché par une\\nMéga-Gemme."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7402
msgid "MARSHADOW"
msgstr "MARSHADOW"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7405
msgid "Gloomdwellr"
msgstr "Ombrefuge"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7408
msgid ""
"Able to conceal itself in the shadows of\\nothers, it never appears before "
"humans,\\nso its very existence is the stuff of myth.\\nThis Pokémon is "
"craven and cowering."
msgstr ""
"Capable de se cacher dans l’ombre d’autrui,\\nil ne se montre jamais aux "
"humains: son\\nexistence relève du mythe. Ce Pokémon est\\ntrès craintif."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7474
msgid "POIPOLE"
msgstr "VEMINI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7480
msgid ""
"This Ultra Beast is well enough\\nliked to be chosen as a\\nfirst partner in"
" its own world."
msgstr ""
"Dans son monde, cette Ultra-Chimère\\nconciliante est un compagnon de "
"voyage\\ntrès apprécié."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7540
msgid "NAGANADEL"
msgstr "MANDRILLON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7546
msgid ""
"It stores hundreds of liters of poisonous\\nliquid inside its body. It is "
"one of the\\norganisms known as UBs."
msgstr ""
"Son corps contient des hectolitres de\\npoison. Il fait partie des "
"créatures\\nnommées “Ultra-Chimères”."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7608
msgid "STAKATAKA"
msgstr "AMA-AMA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7611
msgid "Rampart"
msgstr "Muraille"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7614
msgid ""
"It appeared from an Ultra Wormhole. Each\\none appears to be made up of many"
" life-\\nforms stacked one on top of each other."
msgstr ""
"Il est sorti d’une Ultra-Brèche. Il est\\ncomposé de petites entités "
"qui\\ns’assemblent pour n’en former qu’une seule."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7675
msgid "BLACEPHALON"
msgstr "PIERROTEKNIK"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7678
msgid "Fireworks"
msgstr "Artificier"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7681
msgid ""
"It slithers toward people and explode\\nits head without warning. It "
"is\\none kind of Ultra Beast."
msgstr ""
"Il s’approche des gens en ondulant et fait\\nexploser sa tête sans prévenir."
" C’est une\\nUltra-Chimère."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7741
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7810
msgid "ZERAORA"
msgstr "ZERAORA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7744
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7817
msgid "Thunderclap"
msgstr "Vif Eclair"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7747
msgid ""
"It approaches its enemies at the speed\\nof lightning, then tears them limb "
"from\\nlimb with its sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"Il prend l’ennemi par surprise en attaquant\\nplus vite que l’éclair, et le "
"débite en\\nmorceaux avec ses griffes acérées."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7820
msgid ""
"It stores up 10 lightning strikes' worth\\nof electricity. When it stops "
"limiting\\nitself, it's in the strongest class of\\nelectric Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"Il emmagasine l’électricité de 10 coups\\nde foudre. Quand il cesse de se "
"brider,\\nil fait partie des Pokémon Electrik les\\nplus puissants."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7873
msgid "MELTAN"
msgstr "MELTAN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7876
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7941
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:8009
msgid "Hex Nut"
msgstr "Ecrou"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7879
msgid ""
"It melts particles of iron and other metals\\nfound in the subsoil, so it "
"can absorb them\\ninto its body of molten steel."
msgstr ""
"Il fait fondre le fer et les métaux\\ncontenus dans le sol pour les intégrer"
" à\\nson corps d’acier fondu."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7938
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:8006
msgid "MELMETAL"
msgstr "MELMETAL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:7944
msgid ""
"Revered long ago for its capacity to\\ncreate iron from nothing, for some "
"reason\\nit has come back to life after 3,000 years."
msgstr ""
"Jadis vénéré pour son aptitude à produire\\ndu fer, il a mystérieusement "
"ressuscité\\naprès 3000 ans."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_7_families.h:8012
msgid ""
"In a distant land, there are\\nlegends about a cyclopean giant. In "
"fact,\\nthe giant was a Melmetal that was\\nflooded with Gigantamax energy."
msgstr ""
"Dans une contrée lointaine, des légendes\\nparlent d’un géant cyclopéen. En "
"fait, ce\\ngéant était un MELMETAL gorgé d’énergie\\nGigamax."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:26
msgid "GROOKEY"
msgstr "OUISTEMPO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:32
msgid ""
"When it uses its special stick to strike up\\na beat, the sound waves "
"produced carry\\nrevitalizing energy to the plants and\\nflowers in the "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Le rythme qu’il crée en tapant avec son\\nbâton très spécial génère des "
"ondes\\nsonores qui ont le pouvoir de vivifier les\\nplantes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:91
msgid "THWACKEY"
msgstr "BADABOUIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:94
msgid "Beat"
msgstr "Percussions"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Les Badabouin qui suivent le rythme le
#. plus\neffréné avec leurs deux bâtons sont les\nplus respectés.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:97
msgid ""
"The faster a Thwackey can beat out\\na rhythm with its two sticks, the "
"more\\nrespect it wins from its peers."
msgstr ""
"Les BADABOUIN qui suivent le rythme le plus\\neffréné avec leurs deux bâtons"
" sont les\\nplus respectés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:154
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:219
msgid "RILLABOOM"
msgstr "GORYTHMIC"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:157
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:222
msgid "Drummer"
msgstr "Batteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:160
msgid ""
"By drumming, it taps into the power of\\nits special tree stump. The roots "
"of the\\nstump follow its direction in battle."
msgstr ""
"Il contrôle le pouvoir de sa souche\\nsingulière en tapant en rythme dessus."
" Il\\nse bat en manipulant des racines."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:225
msgid ""
"Rillaboom has become one with its\\nforest of drums and continues to "
"lay\\ndown beats that shake all of Galar."
msgstr ""
"GORYTHMIC ne fait plus qu’un avec sa\\nforêt de tambours et continue "
"de\\njouer des rythmes qui font trembler\\ntout Galar."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:279
msgid "SCORBUNNY"
msgstr "FLAMBINO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:285
msgid ""
"A warm-up of running around gets fire\\nenergy coursing through this "
"Pokémon's\\nbody. Once that happens, it's ready to\\nfight at full power."
msgstr ""
"Il court pour augmenter sa température et\\nfaire circuler l’énergie "
"incandescente\\ndans son corps. Il peut ainsi déployer\\ntoute sa puissance."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:344
msgid "RABOOT"
msgstr "LAPYRO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:350
msgid ""
"Its thick and fluffy fur protects it\\nfrom the cold and enables it to "
"use\\nhotter fire moves."
msgstr ""
"Son pelage épais lui permet de mieux\\nrésister au froid et d’augmenter la "
"chaleur\\nde ses capacités Feu."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:407
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:473
msgid "CINDERACE"
msgstr "PYROBUT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:410
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:476
msgid "Striker"
msgstr "Buteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:413
msgid ""
"It juggles a pebble with its feet,\\nturning it into a burning soccer "
"ball.\\nIts shots strike opponents hard and\\nleave them scorched."
msgstr ""
"Il drible avec des pierres pour en faire des\\nballons enflammés, avant de "
"tirer sur ses\\nadversaires pour les brûler."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:479
msgid ""
"Infused with Cinderace's fighting\\nspirit, the gigantic Pyro Ball "
"never\\nmisses its targets and completely\\nroasts opponents."
msgstr ""
"Empli de l’esprit combatif de PYROBUT,\\nle gigantesque Ballon Brûlant ne "
"rate\\njamais sa cible et calcine\\ncomplètement l’adversaire."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:535
msgid "SOBBLE"
msgstr "LARMELEON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:538
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:603
msgid "Water Lizard"
msgstr "Lézard’Eau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:541
msgid ""
"When scared, this Pokémon cries.\\nIts tears pack the chemical punch of "
"100\\nonions, and attackers won't be\\nable to resist weeping."
msgstr ""
"Quand il a peur, il pleure des larmes\\ncontenant une substance "
"lacrymogène\\naussi puissante que cent oignons."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:600
msgid "DRIZZILE"
msgstr "ARROZARD"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:606
msgid ""
"A clever combatant, this Pokémon battles\\nusing water balloons created "
"with\\nmoisture secreted from its palms."
msgstr ""
"Il crée des bombes à eau avec le liquide que\\nsécrètent ses paumes. Il s’en"
" sert dans les\\ncombats où la stratégie prime."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:663
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:729
msgid "INTELEON"
msgstr "LEZARGUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:666
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:732
msgid "Secret Agent"
msgstr "Agent Secret"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:669
msgid ""
"It has many hidden capabilities, such as\\nfingertips that can shoot water "
"and a\\nmembrane on its back that it can use to\\nglide through the air."
msgstr ""
"Il a plus d’un tour dans son sac: il tire des\\ngerbes d’eau du bout de ses "
"doigts et plane\\ndans les airs grâce à ses membranes\\ndorsales."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:735
msgid ""
"Gigantamax Inteleon's Water Gun\\nmove fires at Mach 7. As the "
"Pokémon\\ntakes aim, it uses the crest on its\\nhead to gauge wind and "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Le Pistolet à O de LEZARGUS Gigamax\\natteint Mach 7. Pour viser, il "
"évalue\\nle vent et la température avec la\\ncrête de sa tête."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:791
msgid "SKWOVET"
msgstr "RONGOURMAND"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:794
msgid "Cheeky"
msgstr "Joufflu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:797
msgid ""
"Found throughout the Galar region, this\\nPokémon becomes uneasy if its "
"cheeks are\\never completely empty of berries."
msgstr ""
"On le trouve partout à Galar. S’il n’a pas de\\nBaies en réserve dans ses "
"deux joues, il\\ndevient anxieux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:856
msgid "GREEDENT"
msgstr "RONGRIGOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:859
msgid "Greedy"
msgstr "Goulu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:862
msgid ""
"It stashes berries in its tail--so many\\nberries that they fall out "
"constantly.\\nBut this Pokémon is a bit slow-witted,\\nso it doesn't notice "
"the loss."
msgstr ""
"Il amasse tellement de Baies dans sa queue\\nqu’elles tombent les unes après"
" les autres,\\nmais il est si étourdi qu’il ne s’en rend pas\\ncompte."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:921
msgid "ROOKIDEE"
msgstr "MINISANGE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:927
msgid ""
"It will bravely challenge any opponent,\\nno matter how powerful. This "
"Pokémon\\nbenefits from every battle--even a\\ndefeat increases its strength"
" a bit."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon brave affronte même les\\nadversaires les plus redoutables. "
"Il\\ndevient plus fort à mesure qu’il subit les\\ncontre-attaques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:994
msgid "CORVISQUIRE"
msgstr "BLEUSEILLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:997
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1070
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1140
msgid "Raven"
msgstr "Corbeau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1000
msgid ""
"Smart enough to use tools in battle,\\nthese Pokémon have been seen picking "
"up\\nrocks and flinging them or using ropes\\nto wrap up enemies."
msgstr ""
"Il sait utiliser des objets avec ses serres:\\nil peut par exemple lancer "
"des pierres ou\\nmême enrouler une corde autour d’un ennemi."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1067
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1137
msgid "CORVIKNIGHT"
msgstr "CORVAILLUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1073
msgid ""
"This Pokémon reigns supreme in the skies\\nof the Galar region. The black "
"luster of\\nits steel body could drive terror into\\nthe heart of any foe."
msgstr ""
"Il n’a aucun rival dans le ciel de Galar.\\nL’aspect intimidant de son corps"
" d’acier\\nnoir et lustré inspire la crainte chez ses\\nennemis."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1143
msgid ""
"Imbued with Gigantamax energy, its\\nwings can whip up winds more\\nforceful"
" than any a hurricane could\\nmuster. The gusts blow everything away."
msgstr ""
"Imprégnées d’énergie Gigamax, ses ailes\\nsoulèvent des vents plus "
"violents\\nqu’un ouragan. Ses rafales emportent\\ntout."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1198
msgid "BLIPBUG"
msgstr "LARVADAR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1204
msgid ""
"A constant collector of information,\\nthis Pokémon is very smart. Very "
"strong\\nis what it isn't."
msgstr ""
"Il passe son temps à recueillir des\\ninformations. Son intelligence est "
"très\\ndéveloppée, mais sa force laisse à désirer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1264
msgid "DOTTLER"
msgstr "COLEODOME"

#. source : patch FR actuel (récupéré par pointeur)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1267
msgid "Radome"
msgstr "Radôme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1270
msgid ""
"It barely moves, but it's still alive.\\nHiding in its shell without food "
"or\\nwater seems to have awakened its\\npsychic powers."
msgstr ""
"Il ne bouge presque pas, mais il est bien\\nvivant. On dit qu’il aurait "
"découvert ses\\npouvoirs psychiques à force de jeûner dans\\nsa coquille."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1329
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1397
msgid "ORBEETLE"
msgstr "ASTRONELLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1332
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1400
msgid "Seven Spot"
msgstr "Sept Points"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1335
msgid ""
"It's famous for its high level of\\nintelligence, and the large size of "
"its\\nbrain is proof that it also possesses\\nimmense psychic power."
msgstr ""
"Il est renommé pour son intelligence. Son\\ngros cerveau est un indicateur "
"de la\\npuissance de ses pouvoirs psychiques."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1403
msgid ""
"Its brain has grown to a gargantuan\\nsize, as has the rest of its "
"body.\\nThis Pokémon's intellect and\\npsychic abilities are overpowering."
msgstr ""
"Son cerveau est devenu gigantesque,\\ncomme le reste de son corps. "
"Son\\nintellect et ses pouvoirs psychiques\\nsont écrasants."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1458
msgid "NICKIT"
msgstr "GOUPILOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1464
msgid ""
"Aided by the soft pads on its feet, it\\nsilently raids the food stores of "
"other\\nPokémon. It survives off its\\nill-gotten gains."
msgstr ""
"Il vit en subtilisant la nourriture des\\nautres Pokémon. Grâce à ses "
"coussinets\\nmoelleux, il ne fait aucun bruit quand il\\nmarche."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1523
msgid "THIEVUL"
msgstr "ROUBLENARD"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1529
msgid ""
"It secretly marks potential targets with\\na scent. By following the scent, "
"it\\nstalks its targets and steals from them\\nwhen they least expect it."
msgstr ""
"Il marque sa victime pour la suivre à\\nl’odeur. Sitôt qu’elle est "
"distraite, il\\ns’empresse de lui voler ses biens."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1588
msgid "GOSSIFLEUR"
msgstr "TOURNICOTON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1594
msgid ""
"It anchors itself in the ground with its\\nsingle leg, then basks in the "
"sun. After\\nabsorbing enough sunlight, its petals\\nspread as it blooms "
"brilliantly."
msgstr ""
"Quand il plante son unique pied pour\\nabsorber la lumière du soleil, ses "
"pétales\\nprennent une couleur éclatante."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1653
msgid "ELDEGOSS"
msgstr "BLANCOTON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1656
msgid "Cotton Bloom"
msgstr "Chef-Coton"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1659
msgid ""
"The seeds attached to its cotton fluff\\nare full of nutrients. It spreads "
"them\\non the wind so that plants and other\\nPokémon can benefit from them."
msgstr ""
"Les graines de son duvet sont remplies de\\nnutriments. Elles sont emportées"
" par le\\nvent et redonnent vitalité aux plantes et\\naux Pokémon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1718
msgid "WOOLOO"
msgstr "MOUMOUTON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1721
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1786
msgid "Sheep"
msgstr "Mouton"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1724
msgid ""
"Its curly fleece is such an effective\\ncushion that this Pokémon could fall"
" off\\na cliff and stand right back up at the\\nbottom, unharmed."
msgstr ""
"Son pelage frisé est doux et rebondi comme\\nun coussin. Une telle toison le"
" protègerait\\nmême s’il chutait d’une falaise."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1783
msgid "DUBWOOL"
msgstr "MOUMOUFLON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1789
msgid ""
"Weave a carpet from its springy wool,\\nand you end up with something closer"
" to\\na trampoline. You'll start to bounce the\\nmoment you set foot on it."
msgstr ""
"Sa laine est si élastique que les tapis\\nfabriqués avec cette matière sont "
"aussi\\nrebondissants qu’un trampoline."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1848
msgid "CHEWTLE"
msgstr "KHELOCROK"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1851
msgid "Snapping"
msgstr "Mordillage"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1854
msgid ""
"Apparently the itch of its teething\\nimpels it to snap its jaws at "
"anything\\nin front of it."
msgstr ""
"Il mord tout ce qui passe sous ses yeux. On\\ndit que ses incisives qui "
"poussent le\\ndémangent."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1916
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1985
msgid "DREDNAW"
msgstr "TORGAMORD"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1922
msgid ""
"With jaws that can shear through steel\\nrods, this highly aggressive "
"Pokémon\\nchomps down on its unfortunate prey."
msgstr ""
"De nature très violente, il mord ses proies\\navec sa mâchoire, assez "
"puissante pour\\nbroyer une barre de fer."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:1991
msgid ""
"In the Galar region, there's a tale\\nabout this Pokémon chewing up "
"a\\nmountain and using the rubble to stop a\\nflood."
msgstr ""
"A Galar, on raconte que ce Pokémon a\\ndéchiqueté une montagne et "
"s’est\\lservi des gravats pour arrêter une\\linondation."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2046
msgid "YAMPER"
msgstr "VOLTOUTOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2052
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is very popular as a\\nherding dog in the Galar region. As "
"it\\nruns, it generates electricity from the\\nbase of its tail."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu’il court, on peut voir de\\nl’électricité se former à la base de "
"sa\\nqueue. Ce Pokémon est très populaire\\nauprès des bergers de Galar."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2111
msgid "BOLTUND"
msgstr "FULGUDOG"

#. source : relu et corrigé à la main
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2114
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1525
msgid "Dog"
msgstr "Chien"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2117
msgid ""
"This Pokémon generates electricity and\\nchannels it into its legs to keep "
"them\\ngoing strong. Boltund can run nonstop\\nfor three full days."
msgstr ""
"Il produit de l’électricité puis la\\ntransfère dans ses pattes pour "
"mieux\\ncourir. Ainsi, il peut foncer pendant trois\\njours et trois nuits."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2176
msgid "ROLYCOLY"
msgstr "CHARBI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2182
msgid ""
"Most of its body has the same composition\\nas coal. Fittingly, this Pokémon"
" was\\nfirst discovered in coal mines about\\n400 years ago."
msgstr ""
"On l’a découvert dans une mine il y a 400\\nans. Son corps est presque "
"entièrement\\ncomposé d’une substance identique au\\ncharbon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2241
msgid "CARKOL"
msgstr "WAGOMINE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2247
msgid ""
"It forms coal inside its body. Coal\\ndropped by this Pokémon once helped "
"fuel\\nthe lives of people in the Galar region."
msgstr ""
"Il produit du charbon dans son corps.\\nJadis, les habitants de Galar "
"ramassaient\\nce charbon pour leurs besoins quotidiens."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2304
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2370
msgid "COALOSSAL"
msgstr "MONTHRACITE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2310
msgid ""
"It's usually peaceful, but the vandalism\\nof mines enrages it. Offenders "
"will be\\nincinerated with flames that reach\\n2,700 degrees Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""
"Il est d’une nature paisible, mais si les\\nhumains tentent de piller ses "
"mines, il\\nenrage et brûle tout avec des flammes à\\n1500 degrés."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2376
msgid ""
"Its body is a colossal stove. With\\nGigantamax energy stoking the "
"fire,\\nthis Pokémon's flame burns hotter\\nthan 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""
"Son corps est un poêle colossal.\\nAttisée par l’énergie Gigamax, "
"la\\nflamme de ce Pokémon brûle à plus de\\n2 000 degrés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2431
msgid "APPLIN"
msgstr "VERPOM"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2434
msgid "Apple Core"
msgstr "Nid Pomme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2437
msgid ""
"It spends its entire life inside an\\napple. It hides from its natural "
"enemies,\\nbird Pokémon, by pretending it's just an\\napple and nothing "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Il vit toujours dans sa pomme. S’il\\ncroise un Pokémon oiseau, son "
"prédateur\\nnaturel, il se fait passer pour un simple\\nfruit pour se "
"protéger."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2505
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2571
msgid "FLAPPLE"
msgstr "POMDRAPI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2508
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2574
msgid "Apple Wing"
msgstr "Ailes Pomme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2511
msgid ""
"It ate a sour apple, and that induced its\\nevolution. In its cheeks, it "
"stores an acid\\ncapable of causing chemical burns."
msgstr ""
"Il a évolué après avoir mangé une\\npomme acide. Il concentre dans "
"ses\\njoues un liquide si corrosif qu’il\\npeut provoquer des brûlures."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2577
msgid ""
"Under the influence of Gigantamax\\nenergy, it produces much more "
"sweet\\nnectar, and its shape has changed\\nto resemble a giant apple."
msgstr ""
"Sous l’effet de l’énergie Gigamax, il\\nproduit bien plus de nectar sucré "
"et\\lsa forme rappelle celle d’une pomme\\lgéante."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2630
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2696
msgid "APPLETUN"
msgstr "DRATATIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2633
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2699
msgid "Apple Nectar"
msgstr "Jus Pomme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2636
msgid ""
"Eating a sweet apple caused its evolution.\\nA nectarous scent wafts from "
"its body,\\nluring in the bug Pokémon it preys on."
msgstr ""
"Il a évolué après avoir mangé une pomme\\nsucrée. Il attire ses proies, les "
"Pokémon\\nInsecte, en dégageant un parfum mielleux."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2702
msgid ""
"Due to Gigantamax energy, this\\nPokémon's nectar has thickened. "
"The\\nincreased viscosity lets the nectar\\nabsorb more damage than before."
msgstr ""
"Sous l’effet de l’énergie Gigamax, le\\nnectar de ce Pokémon s’est "
"épaissi.\\nPlus visqueux, il absorbe davantage\\nde dégâts qu’avant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2756
msgid "DIPPLIN"
msgstr "POMDRAMOUR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2759
msgid "Candy Apple"
msgstr "Sirop Pomme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2762
msgid ""
"Dipplin is two creatures in one Pokémon.\\nIts evolution was triggered by a "
"special\\napple grown only in one place."
msgstr ""
"Pomdramour est un Pokémon composé de\\ndeux créatures. Son évolution a "
"été\\ndéclenchée par une pomme spéciale qui\\nne pousse qu’à un seul "
"endroit."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2820
msgid "HYDRAPPLE"
msgstr "POMDOROCHI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2823
msgid "Apple Hydra"
msgstr "Hydre Pomme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2826
msgid ""
"These capricious syrpents have\\nbanded together. On the rare\\noccasion "
"that their moods align,\\ntheir true power is unleashed."
msgstr ""
"Ces serpents sirupeux et capricieux\\nse sont regroupés. Dans les rares "
"cas\\noù leurs humeurs s’accordent, leur vrai\\npouvoir se déchaîne."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2886
msgid "SILICOBRA"
msgstr "DUNAJA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2889
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2953
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3019
msgid "Sand Snake"
msgstr "Serpensable"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2892
msgid ""
"As it digs, it swallows sand and stores\\nit in its neck pouch. The pouch "
"can hold\\nmore than 17 pounds of sand."
msgstr ""
"Il amasse le sable qu’il avale en creusant\\ndans la poche de son cou. Elle "
"peut en\\ncontenir jusqu’à huit kilos."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2950
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3016
msgid "SANDACONDA"
msgstr "DUNACONDA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:2956
msgid ""
"When it contracts its body, over 220\\npounds of sand sprays from its nose. "
"If\\nit ever runs out of sand, it becomes\\ndisheartened."
msgstr ""
"Il peut expulser 100 kg de sable de ses\\nnarines en compressant tout son "
"corps.\\nQuand il est à court de sable, il a tendance\\nà se dérober."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3022
msgid ""
"Its sand pouch has grown to tremendous\\nproportions. More than 1,000,000 "
"tons of\\nsand now swirl around its body with enough\\nspeed and power to "
"pulverize a skyscraper."
msgstr ""
"Son sac de sable est devenu énorme.\\nPlus d’un million de tonnes de "
"sable\\ltournoient autour de lui assez vite\\let fort pour broyer un gratte-"
"ciel."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3077
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3142
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3200
msgid "CRAMORANT"
msgstr "NIGOSIER"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3080
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3145
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3203
msgid "Gulp"
msgstr "Avaltouron"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3083
msgid ""
"It's so strong that it can knock out some\\nopponents in a single hit, but "
"it also may\\nforget what it's battling midfight."
msgstr ""
"Il peut terrasser un ennemi d’un seul coup,\\nmais il est si nigaud qu’il "
"oublie contre qui\\nil se bat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3148
msgid ""
"Cramorant's gluttony led it to try\\nto swallow an Arrokuda whole, "
"which\\nin turn led to Cramorant getting an\\nArrokuda stuck in its throat."
msgstr ""
"Par gourmandise, Nigosier a voulu\\navaler un Embrochet tout rond, qui\\na "
"fini coincé dans sa gorge."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3206
msgid ""
"This Cramorant has accidentally\\ngotten a Pikachu lodged in its "
"gullet.\\nCramorant is choking a little, but it\\nisn't really bothered."
msgstr ""
"Ce Nigosier a avalé un Pikachu par\\nmégarde. Il s’étouffe un peu, mais\\nça"
" ne le dérange pas vraiment."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3260
msgid "ARROKUDA"
msgstr "EMBROCHET"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3263
msgid "Rush"
msgstr "Fonceur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3266
msgid ""
"If it sees any movement around it, this\\nPokémon charges for it "
"straightaway,\\nleading with its sharply pointed jaw.\\nIt's very proud of "
"that jaw."
msgstr ""
"Sa mâchoire fine et aiguisée fait sa fierté.\\nA peine voit-il le moindre "
"mouvement qu’il\\nfonce dans sa direction."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3325
msgid "BARRASKEWDA"
msgstr "HASTACUDA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3328
msgid "Skewer"
msgstr "Transperceur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3331
msgid ""
"This Pokémon has a jaw that's as sharp\\nas a spear and as strong as "
"steel.\\nApparently Barraskewda's flesh is\\nsurprisingly tasty, too."
msgstr ""
"Sa mâchoire pointue comme une lance est\\naussi dure que l’acier, et sa "
"chair serait,\\ncontre toute attente, succulente."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3390
msgid "TOXEL"
msgstr "TOXIZAP"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Poupon
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3393
msgid "Baby"
msgstr "BEBE"

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Sa peau sécrète les toxines accumulées\ndans sa
#. poche de poison interne. Quand on\nle touche, on se fait électrocuter.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3396
msgid ""
"It stores poison in an internal poison\\nsac and secretes that poison "
"through its\\nskin. If you touch this Pokémon, a\\ntingling sensation "
"follows."
msgstr ""
"Sa peau sécrète les toxines\\naccumulées dans sa poche de\\npoison interne. "
"Le toucher\\nprovoque des picotements."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3456
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3523
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3578
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3644
msgid "TOXTRICITY"
msgstr "SALARSEN"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3459
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3526
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3581
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3647
msgid "Punk"
msgstr "Punk"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3462
msgid ""
"When this Pokémon sounds as if it's\\nstrumming a guitar, it's actually "
"clawing\\nat the protrusions on its chest to\\ngenerate electricity."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu’il gratte l’excroissance sur son\\nventre pour produire de "
"l’électricité, on\\npeut entendre un son similaire à celui d’une\\nguitare."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3584
msgid ""
"Capable of generating 15,000 volts\\nof electricity, this Pokémon "
"looks\\ndown on all that would challenge it."
msgstr ""
"Capable de produire 15000 volts,\\nce Pokémon toise tous ceux qui\\nosent le"
" défier."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3701
msgid "SIZZLIPEDE"
msgstr "GRILLEPATTES"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3704
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3772
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3842
msgid "Radiator"
msgstr "Calorifère"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3707
msgid ""
"It stores flammable gas in its body and\\nuses it to generate heat. The "
"yellow\\nsections on its belly get particularly hot."
msgstr ""
"Il produit de la chaleur grâce au gaz\\ninflammable stocké dans son corps. "
"Le\\njaune de son ventre est très brûlant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3769
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3839
msgid "CENTISKORCH"
msgstr "SCOLOCENDRE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3775
msgid ""
"When it heats up, its body temperature\\nreaches about 1,500 degrees "
"Fahrenheit.\\nIt lashes its body like a whip and\\nlaunches itself at "
"enemies."
msgstr ""
"Quand il chauffe, sa température atteint\\nenviron 800 degrés. Il se sert de"
" son corps\\ncomme d’un fouet pour sauter sur ses\\nennemis."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3845
msgid ""
"The heat that comes off a\\nGigantamax Centiskorch may\\ndestabilize air "
"currents. Sometimes\\nit can even cause storms."
msgstr ""
"La chaleur dégagée par un\\nSCOLOCENDRE Gigamax peut perturber\\nles "
"courants d’air. Elle provoque\\nparfois même des tempêtes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3900
msgid "CLOBBOPUS"
msgstr "POULPAF"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3903
msgid "Tantrum"
msgstr "Caprice"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3906
msgid ""
"It's very curious, but its means of\\ninvestigating things is to try to "
"punch\\nthem with its tentacles. The search for\\nfood is what brings it "
"onto land."
msgstr ""
"Il se rend sur la terre ferme pour se\\nnourrir. Très curieux, son premier "
"réflexe\\nest de frapper tout ce qu’il voit avec ses\\ntentacules."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3965
msgid "GRAPPLOCT"
msgstr "KRAKOS"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3968
msgid "Jujitsu"
msgstr "Jujitsu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:3971
msgid ""
"A body made up of nothing but muscle makes\\nthe grappling moves this "
"Pokémon performs\\nwith its tentacles tremendously powerful."
msgstr ""
"Son corps est un amas de muscles. Les\\nprises d’étranglement qu’il exécute "
"avec\\nses tentacules sont saisissantes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4029
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4096
msgid "SINISTEA"
msgstr "THEFFROI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4032
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4099
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4167
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4232
msgid "Black Tea"
msgstr "Thé Noir"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4035
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is said to have been born\\nwhen a lonely spirit possessed a "
"cold,\\nleftover cup of tea."
msgstr ""
"On raconte que ce Pokémon est né\\nlorsqu’une âme esseulée a plongé dans "
"un\\nreste de thé noir froid."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4102
msgid ""
"The swirl pattern in this Pokémon's\\nbody is its weakness. If it "
"gets\\nstirred, the swirl loses its shape, and\\nSinistea gets dizzy."
msgstr ""
"Le motif en spirale de son corps est\\nson point faible. Si on le "
"remue,\\nla spirale se déforme et Théffroi\\na le tournis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4164
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4229
msgid "POLTEAGEIST"
msgstr "POLTHEGEIST"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4170
msgid ""
"This species lives in antique teapots.\\nMost pots are forgeries, but on "
"rare\\noccasions, an authentic work is found."
msgstr ""
"Il loge dans des théières antiques. La\\nplupart sont des contrefaçons, mais"
" il lui\\narrive de trouver des originaux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4235
msgid ""
"Trainers Polteageist trusts will be\\nallowed to experience "
"its\\ndistinctive flavor and aroma firsthand by\\nsampling just a tiny bit "
"of its tea."
msgstr ""
"Les Dresseurs qui ont sa confiance\\npeuvent goûter un peu de son thé "
"et\\napprécier son arôme et sa saveur\\nuniques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4297
msgid "HATENNA"
msgstr "BIBICHUT"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#: data/scripts/debug.inc:762
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4300
msgid "Calm"
msgstr "Calme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4303
msgid ""
"Via the protrusion on its head, it senses\\nother creatures' emotions. If "
"you don't\\nhave a calm disposition, it will never\\nwarm up to you."
msgstr ""
"La protubérance sur sa tête lui permet de\\npercevoir les émotions des êtres"
" vivants.\\nIl n’accorde sa confiance qu’aux gens\\ncalmes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4362
msgid "HATTREM"
msgstr "CHAPOTUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4365
msgid "Serene"
msgstr "Serein"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4368
msgid ""
"No matter who you are, if you bring strong\\nemotions near this Pokémon, it "
"will silence\\nyou violently."
msgstr ""
"S’il ressent des émotions trop fortes, il en\\nfait taire la source, quelle "
"qu’elle soit,\\npar des méthodes assez violentes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4425
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4490
msgid "HATTERENE"
msgstr "SORCILENCE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4428
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4493
msgid "Silent"
msgstr "Silencieux"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4431
msgid ""
"It emits psychic power strong enough to\\ncause headaches as a deterrent to "
"the\\napproach of others."
msgstr ""
"Il éloigne les autres êtres vivants en\\némettant des ondes psychiques "
"qui\\ndonnent des maux de tête épouvantables."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4496
msgid ""
"This Pokémon can read the\\nemotions of creatures over 30 miles away.\\nThe "
"minute it senses hostility, it\\ngoes on the attack."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon perçoit les émotions des\\ncréatures à plus de 50 km. Dès qu’il "
"sent\\nde l’hostilité, il passe à l’attaque."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4551
msgid "IMPIDIMP"
msgstr "GRIMALIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4557
msgid ""
"Through its nose, it sucks in the\\nemanations produced by people "
"and\\nPokémon when they feel annoyed. It\\nthrives off this negative energy."
msgstr ""
"Pour se refaire une santé, il hume l’énergie\\nnégative que les humains et "
"les Pokémon\\ndégagent quand ils sont irrités."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4615
msgid "MORGREM"
msgstr "FOURBELIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4621
msgid ""
"When it gets down on all fours as if to\\nbeg for forgiveness, it's trying "
"to lure\\nopponents in so that it can stab them\\nwith its spear-like hair."
msgstr ""
"Sa technique de combat consiste à faire\\nsemblant de se prosterner devant "
"son\\nadversaire pour le transpercer avec ses\\ncheveux aiguisés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4680
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4745
msgid "GRIMMSNARL"
msgstr "ANGOLIATH"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4683
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4748
msgid "Bulk Up"
msgstr "Gonflette"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Il enroule ses cheveux autour de son corps\npour
#. gonfler ses muscles, ce qui lui permet\nd’enserrer un Mackogneur.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4686
msgid ""
"With the hair wrapped around its body\\nhelping to enhance its muscles, "
"this\\nPokémon can overwhelm even Machamp."
msgstr ""
"Il enroule ses cheveux autour de son corps\\npour gonfler ses muscles, ce "
"qui lui permet\\nd’enserrer un MACKOGNEUR."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4751
msgid ""
"Gigantamax energy has caused more\\nhair to sprout all over its body.\\nWith"
" the added strength, it can jump\\nover the world's tallest building."
msgstr ""
"L’énergie Gigamax a fait pousser plus\\nde poils sur tout son corps. Sa "
"force\\laccrue lui permet de sauter le plus\\lhaut immeuble du monde."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4806
msgid "MILCERY"
msgstr "CREMY"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4809
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5076
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5186
msgid "Cream"
msgstr "Crème"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:4812
msgid ""
"This Pokémon was born from sweet-smelling\\nparticles in the air. Its body "
"is made\\nof cream."
msgstr ""
"Son corps de crème s’est composé à partir\\nde particules au parfum sucré "
"flottant\\ndans l’air."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5073
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5183
msgid "ALCREMIE"
msgstr "CHARMILLY"

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5189
msgid ""
"It launches swarms of missiles,\\neach made of cream and loaded "
"with\\n100,000 kilocalories. Get hit by one of\\nthese, and your head will "
"swim."
msgstr ""
"Il lance des nuées de missiles faits\\nde crème et chargés de\\n100 000 "
"kilocalories. Recevez-en un\\net vous aurez la tête qui tourne."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5245
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5310
msgid "FALINKS"
msgstr "HEXADRON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5248
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5317
msgid "Formation"
msgstr "Escadron"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5251
msgid ""
"Five of them are troopers, and one is the\\nbrass. The brass's orders are "
"absolute."
msgstr ""
"Un chef et cinq cadets forment une entité.\\nLes ordres du chef sont "
"absolus."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5320
msgid ""
"Mega Falinks has taken on the\\nultimate battle formation, which\\ncan be "
"achieved only if the troopers\\nand brass have the strongest of bonds."
msgstr ""
"Méga-HAGOWAK a adopté la formation\\nde combat ultime, possible "
"seulement\\lsi la troupe et le chef sont unis par\\lles liens les plus "
"forts."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5371
msgid "PINCURCHIN"
msgstr "WATTAPIK"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5374
msgid "Sea Urchin"
msgstr "Oursin"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5377
msgid ""
"It feeds on seaweed, using its teeth to\\nscrape it off rocks. Electric "
"current\\nflows from the tips of its spines."
msgstr ""
"De l’électricité jaillit de ses épines. Il\\narrache avec ses dents les "
"algues des\\nrochers pour s’en nourrir."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5437
msgid "SNOM"
msgstr "FRISSONILLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5443
msgid ""
"It spits out thread imbued with a frigid\\nsort of energy and uses it to tie"
" its body\\nto branches, disguising itself as an\\nicicle while it sleeps."
msgstr ""
"Il crache un fil gelé qu’il utilise pour\\ns’accrocher à une branche: il "
"dort ainsi en\\nimitant une stalactite."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5502
msgid "FROSMOTH"
msgstr "BELDENEIGE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5505
msgid "Frost Moth"
msgstr "Mite Givre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5508
msgid ""
"Icy scales fall from its wings like snow\\nas it flies over fields and "
"mountains.\\nThe temperature of its wings is less than\\n-290 degrees "
"Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""
"La température de ses ailes est de -180\\ndegrés. Quand il vole, ses "
"écailles gelées\\ntombent sur le paysage comme des flocons\\nde neige."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5568
msgid "STONJOURNER"
msgstr "DOLMAN"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Mégalithe
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5571
msgid "Big Rock"
msgstr "Gros rocher"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5574
msgid ""
"It stands in grasslands, watching the\\nsun's descent from zenith to "
"horizon. This\\nPokémon has a talent for delivering\\ndynamic kicks."
msgstr ""
"Il se tient immobile dans les plaines et\\npasse son temps à observer la "
"course du\\nsoleil. Son jeu de jambes est phénoménal."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5634
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5700
msgid "EISCUE"
msgstr "BEKAGLACON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5640
msgid ""
"It drifted in on the flow of ocean waters\\nfrom a frigid place. It keeps "
"its head\\niced constantly to make sure it stays\\nnice and cold."
msgstr ""
"Originaire d’une contrée polaire, ce\\nPokémon a débarqué dans la région "
"ballotté\\npar les flots. Il garde toujours la tête\\nfroide."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5706
msgid ""
"The hair on its head connects to\\nthe surface of its brain. When "
"this\\nPokémon has something on its mind,\\nits hair chills the air around "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Ses cheveux sont reliés à la surface\\nde son cerveau. Quand ce Pokémon "
"a\\nquelque chose en tête, ses cheveux\\nrefroidissent l’air alentour."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5760
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5825
msgid "INDEEDEE"
msgstr "WIMESSIR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5766
msgid ""
"It uses the horns on its head to sense the\\nemotions of others. Males will "
"act as\\nvalets for those they serve, looking\\nafter their every need."
msgstr ""
"Il peut sentir les émotions d’autrui avec\\nses cornes. Le mâle reste aux "
"côtés de son\\nDresseur pour s’occuper de lui, tel un\\ndomestique."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5831
msgid ""
"They diligently serve people and\\nPokémon so they can gather feelings\\nof "
"gratitude. The females are\\nparticularly good at babysitting."
msgstr ""
"Elles servent avec zèle humains et\\nPokémon pour recueillir "
"leur\\ngratitude. Les femelles excellent\\nà garder les enfants."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5893
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5959
msgid "MORPEKO"
msgstr "MORPEKO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5896
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5962
msgid "Two-Sided"
msgstr "Volt Face"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5899
msgid ""
"As it eats the seeds stored up in its\\npocket-like pouches, this Pokémon is"
" not\\njust satisfying its constant hunger. It's\\nalso generating "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"Il a toujours un petit creux. Il grignote\\nles graines qu’il a mises dans "
"ses sortes de\\npoches pour produire de l’électricité."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:5965
msgid ""
"Intense hunger drives it to\\nextremes of violence, and the electricity\\nin"
" its cheek sacs has converted into\\na Dark-type energy."
msgstr ""
"Une faim intense le rend violent,\\net l’électricité de ses bajoues\\ns’est "
"changée en énergie de type\\nTénèbres."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6020
msgid "CUFANT"
msgstr "CHARIBARI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6023
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6089
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6155
msgid "Copperderm"
msgstr "Pachycuivre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6026
msgid ""
"It digs up the ground with its trunk.\\nIt's also very strong, being able "
"to\\ncarry loads of over five tons without any\\nproblem at all."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon est assez costaud pour porter\\ndes charges de cinq tonnes sans "
"problème.\\nIl utilise sa trompe pour creuser le sol."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6086
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6152
msgid "COPPERAJAH"
msgstr "PACHYRADJAH"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6092
msgid ""
"They came over from another region long\\nago and worked together with "
"humans.\\nTheir green skin is resistant to water."
msgstr ""
"Sa peau verte résiste bien à l’eau. Venu\\nd’une autre région il y a "
"longtemps, il a\\ntravaillé main dans la main avec les Hommes."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6158
msgid ""
"After this Pokémon has Gigantamaxed,\\nits massive nose can utterly "
"demolish\\nlarge structures with a single\\nsmashing blow."
msgstr ""
"Une fois Gigamaxé, il peut démolir de\\ngrandes structures d’un seul coup "
"de\\lsa trompe massive."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6213
msgid "DRACOZOLT"
msgstr "GALVAGON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6219
msgid ""
"In ancient times, it was unbeatable thanks\\nto its powerful lower body, but"
" it went\\nextinct anyway after it depleted all its\\nplant-based food "
"sources."
msgstr ""
"Jadis, le bas de son corps musclé le rendait\\ninvincible, mais il s’est "
"éteint après avoir\\nmangé toutes les plantes dont il se\\nnourrissait."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6278
msgid "ARCTOZOLT"
msgstr "GALVAGLA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6284
msgid ""
"The shaking of its freezing upper half is\\nwhat generates its electricity. "
"It has a\\nhard time walking around."
msgstr ""
"Quand le haut de son corps couvert de\\nglace frissonne, il produit de "
"l’électricité.\\nIl a bien du mal à marcher."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6342
msgid "DRACOVISH"
msgstr "HYDRAGON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6348
msgid ""
"Powerful legs and jaws made it the apex\\npredator of its time. Its own "
"overhunting\\nof its prey was what drove it to\\nextinction."
msgstr ""
"Ses pattes et ses mâchoires le rendaient\\npresque invincible, mais à trop "
"chasser ses\\nproies, celles-ci ont disparu, et lui avec."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6407
msgid "ARCTOVISH"
msgstr "HYDRAGLA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6413
msgid ""
"Though it's able to capture prey by\\nfreezing its surroundings, it has "
"trouble\\neating the prey afterward because its\\nmouth is on top of its "
"head."
msgstr ""
"Il gèle les alentours pour capturer ses\\nproies, mais comme sa bouche est "
"sur le\\ndessus de sa tête, il a beaucoup de mal à\\nles manger."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6472
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6546
msgid "DURALUDON"
msgstr "DURALUGON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6475
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6549
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6610
msgid "Alloy"
msgstr "Alliage"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6478
msgid ""
"Its body resembles polished metal, and\\nit's both lightweight and strong. "
"The only\\ndrawback is that it rusts easily."
msgstr ""
"Son corps, semblable à du métal poli, allie\\nlégèreté et solidité. "
"Malheureusement, il\\nrouille facilement."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6552
msgid ""
"The hardness of its cells is\\nexceptional, even among Steel types. "
"It\\nalso has a body structure that's\\nresistant to earthquakes."
msgstr ""
"Ses cellules sont d’une dureté\\nexceptionnelle, même parmi les "
"Pokémon\\nAcier. Son corps a aussi une structure\\nqui résiste aux séismes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6607
msgid "ARCHALUDON"
msgstr "PONDRALUGON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6613
msgid ""
"It gathers static electricity\\nfrom its surroundings. The beams\\nit "
"launches when down on all fours\\nare tremendously powerful."
msgstr ""
"Il accumule l’électricité statique\\ndes environs. Les rayons qu’il tire\\nà"
" quatre pattes sont d’une\\npuissance redoutable."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6673
msgid "DREEPY"
msgstr "FANTYRM"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6676
msgid "Lingering"
msgstr "Ame Errante"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6679
msgid ""
"After being reborn as a ghost Pokémon,\\nDreepy wanders the areas it used "
"to\\ninhabit back when it was alive in\\nprehistoric seas."
msgstr ""
"Revenu à la vie sous forme de Pokémon\\nSpectre, il erre au-dessus de la mer"
" dans\\nlaquelle il vivait autrefois."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6739
msgid "DRAKLOAK"
msgstr "DISPAREPTIL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6742
msgid "Caretaker"
msgstr "Baby-sitter"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6745
msgid ""
"It's capable of flying faster than 120 mph.\\nIt battles alongside Dreepy "
"and dotes\\non them until they successfully evolve."
msgstr ""
"Il vole à 200 km/h et se bat aux côtés d’un\\nFantyrm, dont il prend soin "
"jusqu’à son\\névolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6803
msgid "DRAGAPULT"
msgstr "LANSSORIEN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6806
msgid "Stealth"
msgstr "Furtif"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Il vit en compagnie de Fantyrm qui logent\ndans
#. les trous de ses cornes. Quand il\npasse à l’attaque, il les propulse à
#. la\nvitesse du son.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6809
msgid ""
"When it isn't battling, it keeps Dreepy\\nin the holes on its horns. Once a "
"fight\\nstarts, it launches the Dreepy like\\nsupersonic missiles."
msgstr ""
"Il vit en compagnie de FANTYRM qui logent\\ndans les trous de ses cornes. "
"Quand il\\npasse à l’attaque, il les propulse à la\\nvitesse du son."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6869
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6936
msgid "ZACIAN"
msgstr "ZACIAN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6872
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6939
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7010
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7078
msgid "Warrior"
msgstr "Valeureux"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6875
msgid ""
"Known as a legendary hero, this Pokémon\\nabsorbs metal particles, "
"transforming\\nthem into a weapon it uses to battle."
msgstr ""
"Surnommé “héros légendaire”, ce Pokémon\\nabsorbe du métal et se change en "
"arme pour\\nse battre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:6942
msgid ""
"Able to cut down anything with a\\nsingle strike, it became known as "
"the\\nFairy King's Sword, and it inspired\\nawe in friend and foe alike."
msgstr ""
"Capable de tout trancher d’un seul\\ncoup, il fut appelé l’Epée du Roi\\ndes"
" Fées et inspirait le respect à\\nses alliés comme à ses ennemis."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7007
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7075
msgid "ZAMAZENTA"
msgstr "ZAMAZENTA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7013
msgid ""
"In times past, it worked together with a\\nking of the people to save the "
"Galar\\nregion. It absorbs metal that it then\\nuses in battle."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon sauva autrefois Galar en\\njoignant ses forces à celles du roi "
"des\\nHommes. Il absorbe du métal quand il passe\\nau combat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7081
msgid ""
"Its ability to deflect any attack\\nled to it being known as the "
"Fighting\\nMaster's Shield. It was feared and\\nrespected by all."
msgstr ""
"Sa capacité à repousser toute\\nattaque lui a valu le nom de Bouclier\\ndu "
"Roi des Combats. Il était craint\\net respecté de tous."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7146
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7214
msgid "ETERNATUS"
msgstr "ETHERNATOS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7149
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7217
msgid "Gigantic"
msgstr "Giga"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7152
msgid ""
"The core on its chest absorbs energy\\nemanating from the lands of the "
"Galar\\nregion. This energy is what allows\\nEternatus to stay active."
msgstr ""
"Il devient actif en absorbant l’énergie qui\\némerge du sol de Galar grâce "
"au noyau situé\\nsur sa poitrine."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : A cause de Rose, Ethernatos a absorbé\ntoute
#. l’énergie de Galar. Il est\ndésormais en état de surcharge.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7220
msgid ""
"As a result of Rose's meddling,\\nEternatus absorbed all the energy in\\nthe"
" Galar region. It's now in a state\\nof power overload."
msgstr ""
"A cause de Shehroz, ETHERNATOS\\na absorbé toute l’énergie de\\nGalar. Il "
"est désormais en\\nétat de surcharge."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7276
msgid "KUBFU"
msgstr "WUSHOURS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7279
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7349
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7418
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7479
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7548
msgid "Wushu"
msgstr "Kung-fu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7282
msgid ""
"Kubfu trains hard to perfect its moves.\\nThe moves it masters will "
"determine which\\nform it takes when it evolves."
msgstr ""
"Il s’entraîne dur pour parfaire ses\\ntechniques. La forme de son "
"évolution\\ndépend des capacités qu’il a assimilées."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7346
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7415
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7476
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7545
msgid "URSHIFU"
msgstr "SHIFOURS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7352
msgid ""
"This form of Urshifu is a strong believer\\nin the one-hit KO. Its strategy "
"is to leap\\nin close to foes and land a devastating\\nblow with a hardened "
"fist."
msgstr ""
"Adepte des techniques pouvant mettre K.O.\\nen un seul coup, il se jette sur"
" son\\nadversaire et le frappe de son poing\\nrobuste."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7421
msgid ""
"People call it the embodiment of\\nrage. It's said that this "
"Pokémon's\\nterrifying expression and shout will\\nrid the world of "
"malevolence."
msgstr ""
"On l’appelle l’incarnation de la rage.\\nSelon la rumeur, son air terrifiant"
" et\\lson cri débarrasseront le monde de la\\lmalveillance."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7482
msgid ""
"This form of Urshifu is a strong\\nbeliever in defeating foes by "
"raining\\nmany blows down on them. Its\\nstrikes are nonstop, flowing like a"
" river."
msgstr ""
"Cette forme de Shifours croit en la\\nvictoire par une pluie de coups.\\nSes"
" attaques s’enchaînent sans\\nrépit, fluides comme une rivière."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7551
msgid ""
"As it waits for the right moment to\\nunleash its Gigantamax power, "
"this\\nPokémon maintains a perfect one-\\nlegged stance. It won't even "
"twitch."
msgstr ""
"En attendant le bon moment pour\\nlibérer sa puissance Gigamax, ce\\nPokémon"
" tient une posture parfaite\\nsur une patte, sans bouger d’un poil."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7609
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7677
msgid "ZARUDE"
msgstr "ZARUDE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7612
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7680
msgid "Rogue Monkey"
msgstr "Vilain Singe"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7615
msgid ""
"Within dense forests, this Pokémon lives\\nin a pack with others of its "
"kind. It's\\nincredibly aggressive, and the other\\nPokémon of the forest "
"fear it."
msgstr ""
"Ils vivent en groupe dans la jungle, où les\\nautres Pokémon les craignent à"
" cause de\\nleur nature agressive."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7683
msgid ""
"This Zarude's special strength\\nstems from its love and care for "
"an\\norphaned human child that the Pokémon\\nhas raised."
msgstr ""
"La force singulière de ce Zarude\\nvient de l’amour qu’il porte à "
"un\\norphelin humain qu’il a élevé."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/battle_frontier/trainer_hill.h:3729
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7748
msgid "REGIELEKI"
msgstr "REGIELEKI"

#. source : patch FR actuel (récupéré par pointeur)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7751
msgid "Electron"
msgstr "Electron"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7754
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is a cluster of electrical\\nenergy. It's said that removing "
"the rings\\non Regieleki's body will unleash the\\nPokémon's latent power."
msgstr ""
"Son corps est un véritable concentré\\nd’énergie électrique. On raconte que "
"si on\\nlui retire ses anneaux, sa puissance\\ncachée se libère."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7817
msgid "REGIDRAGO"
msgstr "REGIDRAGO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7820
msgid "Dragon Orb"
msgstr "Boule Dragon"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7823
msgid ""
"An academic theory proposes that\\nRegidrago's arms were once the head of "
"an\\nancient dragon Pokémon. The theory\\nremains unproven."
msgstr ""
"Une théorie stipule que ses bras ont la\\nforme de la tête d’un Pokémon "
"Dragon des\\ntemps anciens, mais aucune preuve ne\\nl’atteste."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7885
msgid "GLASTRIER"
msgstr "BLIZZEVAL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7888
msgid "Wild Horse"
msgstr "Cheval Rétif"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7891
msgid ""
"Glastrier emits intense cold from its\\nhooves. It's also a belligerent "
"Pokémon--\\nanything it wants, it takes by force."
msgstr ""
"Violent, il s’empare par la force de tout ce\\nqu’il désire. Il libère un "
"puissant air\\nglacial de ses sabots."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7951
msgid "SPECTRIER"
msgstr "SPECTREVAL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7954
msgid "Swift Horse"
msgstr "Cheval Vif"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:7957
msgid ""
"It probes its surroundings with all its\\nsenses save one--it doesn't use "
"its sense\\nof sight. Spectrier's kicks are said to\\nseparate soul from "
"body."
msgstr ""
"Il se sert de tous ses sens pour se\\nrepérer, sauf celui de la vue. Un coup"
" de\\nses sabots suffirait à séparer l’âme du\\ncorps de sa cible."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8018
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8086
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8155
msgid "CALYREX"
msgstr "SYLVEROY"

#. source : relu et corrigé à la main
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8021
msgid "King"
msgstr "Roi"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8024
msgid ""
"Calyrex is a merciful Pokémon, capable of\\nproviding healing and blessings."
" It\\nreigned over the Galar region in times\\nof yore."
msgstr ""
"Doté de pouvoirs de guérison et\\nd’abondance, ce Pokémon "
"miséricordieux\\nrégnait sur Galar il y a fort longtemps."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8089
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8158
msgid "High King"
msgstr "Empereur"

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8092
msgid ""
"According to lore, this Pokémon\\nshowed no mercy to those who got in\\nits "
"way, yet it would heal its\\nopponents' wounds after battle."
msgstr ""
"Selon la légende, ce Pokémon était\\nsans pitié pour qui lui barrait "
"la\\nroute, mais il soignait les blessures\\nde ses adversaires après le "
"combat."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8161
msgid ""
"It's said that Calyrex and a\\nPokémon that had bonded with it ran "
"all\\nacross the Galar region to bring green\\nto the wastelands."
msgstr ""
"On raconte que SYLVEROY et un\\nPokémon qui s’était lié à lui ont couru\\là "
"travers tout Galar pour faire\\lreverdir les terres désolées."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8227
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8295
msgid "ENAMORUS"
msgstr "AMOVENUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8230
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8298
msgid "Love-Hate"
msgstr "Hainamour"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8233
msgid ""
"Its arrival brings an end to the winter.\\nAccording to legend, this "
"Pokémon's love\\ngives rise to the budding of fresh life\\nacross the land."
msgstr ""
"Sa venue marque la fin de l’hiver. Selon la\\nlégende, l’amour de ce Pokémon"
" fait éclore\\nune vie nouvelle sur toute la terre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_8_families.h:8301
msgid ""
"From the clouds, it descends upon\\nthose who treat any form of life\\nwith "
"disrespect and metes out\\nwrathful, ruthless punishment."
msgstr ""
"Du haut des nuages, il fond sur ceux\\nqui méprisent la vie sous toutes "
"ses\\nformes et leur inflige un châtiment\\nimpitoyable."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:26
msgid "SPRIGATITO"
msgstr "POUSSACHA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:29
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:94
msgid "Grass Cat"
msgstr "Chat Plante"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:32
msgid ""
"The sweet scent its body gives off\\nmesmerizes those around it. The\\nscent"
" grows stronger when this\\nPokémon is in the sun."
msgstr ""
"Le doux parfum de son corps envoûte\\nceux qui l’entourent. Ce "
"parfum\\ns’intensifie quand ce Pokémon\\nest au soleil."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:91
msgid "FLORAGATO"
msgstr "MATOURGEON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:97
msgid ""
"Floragato deftly wields the vine\\nhidden beneath its long fur, "
"slamming\\nthe hard flower bud against its\\nopponents."
msgstr ""
"Matourgeon manie avec adresse la\\nliane cachée sous sa longue\\nfourrure et"
" frappe ses adversaires\\navec son bouton de fleur dur."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:155
msgid "MEOWSCARADA"
msgstr "MIASCARADE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:158
msgid "Magician"
msgstr "Magicien"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:161
msgid ""
"This Pokémon uses the reflective\\nfur lining its cape to camouflage "
"the\\nstem of its flower, creating the\\nillusion that the flower is "
"floating."
msgstr ""
"La doublure réfléchissante de sa\\ncape camoufle la tige de sa fleur,\\npour"
" donner l’illusion que la fleur\\nflotte dans les airs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:220
msgid "FUECOCO"
msgstr "CHOCHODILE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:223
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:288
msgid "Fire Croc"
msgstr "Croco Feu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:226
msgid ""
"Its flame sac is small, so energy is\\nalways leaking out. This energy "
"is\\nreleased from the dent atop\\nFuecoco's head and flickers to and fro."
msgstr ""
"Sa poche à flammes est petite, donc\\nl’énergie fuit sans cesse. "
"Elle\\ns’échappe du creux sur la tête de\\nChochodile et vacille çà et là."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:285
msgid "CROCALOR"
msgstr "CROCOGRIL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:291
msgid ""
"The combination of Crocalor's fire\\nenergy and overflowing vitality "
"has\\ncaused an egg-shaped fireball to\\nappear on the Pokémon's head."
msgstr ""
"L’énergie de feu et la vitalité\\ndébordante de Crocogril ont "
"fait\\napparaître une boule de feu en\\nforme d’œuf sur sa tête."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:349
msgid "SKELEDIRGE"
msgstr "FLAMIGATOR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:352
msgid "Singer"
msgstr "Chanteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:355
msgid ""
"Skeledirge's gentle singing\\nsoothes the souls of all that hear it. "
"It\\nburns its enemies to a crisp with\\nflames of over 5,400 degrees "
"Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""
"Le chant doux de Flâmigator apaise\\nl’âme de ceux qui l’entendent. "
"Il\\ncarbonise ses ennemis avec des\\nflammes de plus de 3000 degrés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:414
msgid "QUAXLY"
msgstr "COIFFETON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:417
msgid "Duckling"
msgstr "Caneton"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:420
msgid ""
"Its strong legs let it easily swim\\naround in even fast-flowing "
"rivers.\\nIt likes to keep things tidy and is\\nprone to overthinking "
"things."
msgstr ""
"Ses pattes robustes lui permettent\\nde nager sans peine dans les "
"rivières\\nles plus agitées. Il aime l’ordre et\\na tendance à trop "
"réfléchir."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:479
msgid "QUAXWELL"
msgstr "CANARBELLO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:482
msgid "Practicing"
msgstr "Leçon"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:485
msgid ""
"The hardworking Quaxwell observes\\npeople and Pokémon from "
"various\\nregions and incorporates their\\nmovements into its own dance "
"routines."
msgstr ""
"Le studieux Canarbello observe les\\ngens et Pokémon d’autres régions "
"et\\nintègre leurs mouvements à ses\\npropres chorégraphies."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:543
msgid "QUAQUAVAL"
msgstr "PALMAVAL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:546
msgid "Dancer"
msgstr "Danseur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:549
msgid ""
"A single kick from a Quaquaval can\\nsend a truck rolling. This "
"Pokémon\\nuses its powerful legs to perform\\nstriking dances from far-off "
"lands."
msgstr ""
"Un seul coup de pied de Palmaval\\npeut renverser un camion. Ses "
"jambes\\npuissantes exécutent des danses\\nvenues de contrées lointaines."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:608
msgid "LECHONK"
msgstr "GOURMELET"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:611
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:677
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:741
msgid "Hog"
msgstr "Pourceau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:614
msgid ""
"It searches for food all day. It\\npossesses a keen sense of smell "
"but\\ndoesn't use it for anything other\\nthan foraging."
msgstr ""
"Il cherche à manger toute la journée.\\nSon odorat est fin, mais il ne "
"s’en\\nsert que pour trouver de la\\nnourriture."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:674
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:738
msgid "OINKOLOGNE"
msgstr "FRAGROIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:680
msgid ""
"Oinkologne is proud of its fine,\\nglossy skin. It emits a "
"concentrated\\nscent from the tip of its tail."
msgstr ""
"Fragroin est fier de sa belle peau\\nlustrée. Il émet une odeur "
"intense\\npar le bout de sa queue."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:744
msgid ""
"This is a meticulous Pokémon that\\nlikes to keep things tidy. It\\nshrouds "
"itself in a floral aroma that\\nsoothes the Pokémon around it."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon méticuleux aime l’ordre.\\nIl s’enveloppe d’un parfum "
"floral\\nqui apaise les Pokémon alentour."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:805
msgid "TAROUNTULA"
msgstr "TISSENBOULE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:808
msgid "String Ball"
msgstr "Boule de Fil"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:811
msgid ""
"The thread it secretes from its\\nrear is as strong as wire. The "
"secret\\nbehind the thread's strength is the\\ntopic of ongoing research."
msgstr ""
"Le fil qu’il sécrète par l’arrière\\nest aussi solide qu’un câble. "
"Le\\nsecret de sa résistance fait encore\\nl’objet de recherches."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:870
msgid "SPIDOPS"
msgstr "FILENTRAPPE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:876
msgid ""
"It clings to branches and ceilings\\nusing its threads and moves without\\na"
" sound. It takes out its prey\\nbefore the prey even notices it."
msgstr ""
"Il se suspend aux branches et aux\\nplafonds avec ses fils et se "
"déplace\\nsans bruit. Il capture sa proie\\navant même qu’elle ne le "
"remarque."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:935
msgid "NYMBLE"
msgstr "LILLITERELLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:938
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1003
msgid "Grasshopper"
msgstr "Sauterelle"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:941
msgid ""
"It has its third set of legs folded\\nup. When it's in a tough spot, "
"this\\nPokémon jumps over 30 feet using the\\nstrength of its legs."
msgstr ""
"Il garde sa 3e paire de pattes\\nrepliée. En cas de danger, il peut\\nbondir"
" à plus de 10 m grâce à la\\nforce de ses pattes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1000
msgid "LOKIX"
msgstr "GAMBEX"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1006
msgid ""
"When it decides to fight all out, it\\nstands on its previously "
"folded\\nlegs to enter Showdown Mode. It\\nneutralizes its enemies in short "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Quand il décide de se battre à fond,\\nil se dresse sur ses pattes "
"repliées\\npour passer en Mode Bagarre et\\nneutralise vite ses ennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1065
msgid "PAWMI"
msgstr "POHM"

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Les coussinets de ses pattes émettent\nde
#. l’électricité. Pohm en décharge\npar ses pattes avant, tout en tenant\nà
#. peine sur ses pattes arrière.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1071
msgid ""
"The pads of its paws are electricity-\\ndischarging organs. Pawmi "
"fires\\nelectricity from its forepaws while\\nstanding unsteadily on its "
"hind legs."
msgstr ""
"Les coussinets de ses pattes émettent\\nde l’électricité. POHM en "
"décharge\\npar ses pattes avant, tout en tenant\\nà peine sur ses pattes "
"arrière."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1130
msgid "PAWMO"
msgstr "POHMOTTE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1136
msgid ""
"When its group is attacked, Pawmo\\nis the first to leap into "
"battle,\\ndefeating enemies with a fighting\\ntechnique that utilizes "
"electric shocks."
msgstr ""
"Quand son groupe est attaqué,\\nPohmotte se bat le premier. Il vainc\\nses "
"ennemis grâce à un art martial\\nà base de décharges électriques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1194
msgid "PAWMOT"
msgstr "POHMARMOTTE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1197
msgid "Hands-On"
msgstr "Pose Paume"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1200
msgid ""
"This Pokémon normally is slow to\\nreact, but once it enters battle, "
"it\\nwill strike down its enemies with\\nlightning-fast movements."
msgstr ""
"D’ordinaire lent à réagir, il\\nterrasse ses ennemis à la vitesse\\nde "
"l’éclair une fois au combat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1259
msgid "TANDEMAUS"
msgstr "COMPAGNOL"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1262
msgid "Couple"
msgstr "Couple"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1265
msgid ""
"Exhibiting great teamwork, they\\nuse their incisors to cut pieces out\\nof "
"any material that might be useful\\nfor a nest, then make off with them."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à leur travail d’équipe, ils\\ndécoupent avec leurs incisives "
"tout\\nce qui peut servir à leur nid, puis\\nl’emportent."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1325
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1390
msgid "MAUSHOLD"
msgstr "FAMIGNOL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1328
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1393
msgid "Family"
msgstr "Famille"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1331
msgid ""
"The little one just appeared one\\nday. They all live together like "
"a\\nfamily, but the relationship between\\nthe three is still unclear."
msgstr ""
"Le petit est apparu un beau jour.\\nIls vivent ensemble comme une\\nfamille,"
" mais on ignore encore les\\nliens qui unissent les trois."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1396
msgid ""
"The larger pair protects the little\\nones during battles. When "
"facing\\nstrong opponents, the whole group\\nwill join the fight."
msgstr ""
"Les deux grands protègent les petits\\npendant les combats. Face à "
"un\\nadversaire coriace, toute la famille\\nse joint à la lutte."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1457
msgid "FIDOUGH"
msgstr "PATACHIOT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1463
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is smooth and moist\\nto the touch. Yeast in Fidough's\\nbreath"
" induces fermentation in the\\nPokémon's vicinity."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon est lisse et humide au\\ntoucher. La levure dans le souffle\\nde "
"Pâtachiot fait fermenter tout ce\\nqui l’entoure."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1522
msgid "DACHSBUN"
msgstr "BRIOCHIEN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1528
msgid ""
"The pleasant aroma that emanates\\nfrom this Pokémon's body helps\\nwheat "
"grow, so Dachsbun has been\\ntreasured by farming villages."
msgstr ""
"L’arôme agréable de son corps aide\\nle blé à pousser. Briochien est "
"donc\\ntrès chéri dans les villages\\nagricoles."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1587
msgid "SMOLIV"
msgstr "OLIVINI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1593
msgid ""
"This Pokémon converts nutrients\\ninto oil, which it stores in the "
"fruit\\non its head. It can easily go a whole\\nweek without eating or "
"drinking."
msgstr ""
"Il transforme ses nutriments en huile\\nqu’il stocke dans le fruit sur "
"sa\\ntête. Il peut tenir une semaine\\nsans boire ni manger."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1652
msgid "DOLLIV"
msgstr "OLIVADO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1658
msgid ""
"Dolliv shares its tasty, fresh-\\nscented oil with others. This "
"species\\nhas coexisted with humans since\\ntimes long gone."
msgstr ""
"Olivado partage son huile fraîche et\\nsavoureuse. Cette espèce vit "
"aux\\ncôtés des humains depuis des temps\\nimmémoriaux."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1716
msgid "ARBOLIVA"
msgstr "ARBOLIVA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1722
msgid ""
"This Pokémon drives back enemies\\nby launching its rich, aromatic oil "
"at\\nthem with enough force to smash a\\nboulder."
msgstr ""
"Il repousse ses ennemis en projetant\\nson huile riche et parfumée "
"avec\\nassez de force pour briser\\nun rocher."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1781
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1847
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1913
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1979
msgid "SQUAWKABILLY"
msgstr "TAPATOES"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1784
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1850
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1916
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1982
msgid "Parrot"
msgstr "Perroquet"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1787
msgid ""
"Green-feathered flocks hold the\\nmost sway. When they're out\\nsearching "
"for food in the mornings and\\nevenings, it gets very noisy."
msgstr ""
"Les nuées au plumage vert sont les\\nplus influentes. Quand "
"elles\\ncherchent à manger, matin et soir,\\nle vacarme est assourdissant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1853
msgid ""
"The largest of their flocks can\\ncontain more than 50 individuals. "
"They\\nfly around towns and forests,\\nsearching for food and making a "
"racket."
msgstr ""
"Leurs plus grandes nuées comptent\\nplus de 50 individus. Ils "
"survolent\\nvilles et forêts en quête de\\nnourriture, à grand fracas."

#. source : patch FR actuel (vérifié)
#. lot : C2b_donnees
#. ancien (patch FR actuel) : Ces Tapatoès au sang chaud ont un\nstyle de
#. combat brutal. Ils bondissent\nsur leurs ennemis pour les affronter\nau
#. corps-à-corps.
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1919
msgid ""
"These Squawkabilly are hotheaded,\\nand their fighting style is "
"vicious.\\nThey'll leap within reach of their\\nfoes to engage in close "
"combat."
msgstr ""
"Ces TAPATOES au sang chaud ont un\\nstyle de combat brutal. Ils "
"bondissent\\nsur leurs ennemis pour les affronter\\nau corps-à-corps."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:1985
msgid ""
"Though these Squawkabilly are the\\nfewest in number, they have no\\ntrouble"
" living in towns since they blend\\nin with the white buildings."
msgstr ""
"Ces Tapatoès sont les moins\\nnombreux, mais vivent sans mal en\\nville, car"
" ils se fondent parmi\\nles bâtiments blancs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2047
msgid "NACLI"
msgstr "SELUTIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2050
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2115
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2179
msgid "Rock Salt"
msgstr "Halite"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2053
msgid ""
"The ground scrapes its body as it\\ntravels, causing it to leave "
"salt\\nbehind. Salt is constantly being created\\nand replenished inside "
"Nacli's body."
msgstr ""
"Son corps frotte le sol quand il se\\ndéplace, laissant du sel "
"derrière\\nlui. Le corps de Selutin produit\\nsans cesse du sel nouveau."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2112
msgid "NACLSTACK"
msgstr "AMASSEL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2118
msgid ""
"It compresses rock salt inside its\\nbody and shoots out hardened "
"salt\\npellets with enough force to\\nperforate an iron sheet."
msgstr ""
"Il comprime du sel gemme dans son\\ncorps et tire des boulettes de "
"sel\\ndurci assez fort pour percer une\\nplaque de fer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2176
msgid "GARGANACL"
msgstr "GIGANSEL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2182
msgid ""
"Garganacl will rub its fingertips\\ntogether and sprinkle injured\\nPokémon "
"with salt. Even severe wounds will\\npromptly heal afterward."
msgstr ""
"Gigansel frotte ses doigts pour\\nsaupoudrer de sel les Pokémon\\nblessés. "
"Même les plaies graves\\nguérissent alors rapidement."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2241
msgid "CHARCADET"
msgstr "CHARBAMBIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2244
msgid "Fire Child"
msgstr "Enfant Feu"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2247
msgid ""
"Burnt charcoal came to life and\\nbecame a Pokémon. Possessing a "
"fiery\\nfighting spirit, Charcadet will\\nbattle even tough opponents."
msgstr ""
"Un charbon brûlé a pris vie pour\\ndevenir un Pokémon. Plein "
"d’ardeur,\\nCharbambin affronte même des\\nadversaires coriaces."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2309
msgid "ARMAROUGE"
msgstr "CARMADURA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2312
msgid "Fire Warrior"
msgstr "Feu Guerrier"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2315
msgid ""
"Armarouge evolved through the use\\nof a set of armor that belonged to\\na "
"distinguished warrior. This\\nPokémon is incredibly loyal."
msgstr ""
"Carmadura est né d’une armure ayant\\nappartenu à un guerrier émérite.\\nCe "
"Pokémon est d’une loyauté\\nsans faille."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2372
msgid "CERULEDGE"
msgstr "MALVALAME"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2375
msgid "Fire Blades"
msgstr "Feu Bretteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2378
msgid ""
"The fiery blades on its arms burn\\nfiercely with the lingering\\nresentment"
" of a sword wielder who fell\\nbefore accomplishing their goal."
msgstr ""
"Les lames ardentes de ses bras\\nbrûlent de la rancœur d’un épéiste\\nmort "
"avant d’avoir atteint\\nson but."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2437
msgid "TADBULB"
msgstr "TETAMPOULE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2440
msgid "EleTadpole"
msgstr "Electêtard"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2443
msgid ""
"Tadbulb shakes its tail to\\ngenerate electricity. If it senses danger,\\nit"
" will make its head blink on and off\\nto alert its allies."
msgstr ""
"Têtampoule agite sa queue pour\\nproduire de l’électricité. S’il sent\\nun "
"danger, il fait clignoter sa tête\\npour alerter ses alliés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2503
msgid "BELLIBOLT"
msgstr "AMPIBIDOU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2506
msgid "EleFrog"
msgstr "Elecrapaud"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2509
msgid ""
"When this Pokémon expands and\\ncontracts its wobbly body, the "
"belly-\\nbutton dynamo in its stomach\\nproduces a huge amount of "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"Quand il gonfle et contracte son\\ncorps mou, la dynamo de son "
"nombril\\nproduit une énorme quantité\\nd’électricité."

#. source : patch FR actuel (correspondance douteuse, à vérifier)
#. source : patch FR actuel (récupéré par pointeur)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2568
msgid "WATTREL"
msgstr "ZAPETREL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2571
msgid "Storm Petrel"
msgstr "Océanite"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2574
msgid ""
"When its wings catch the wind, the\\nbones within produce "
"electricity.\\nThis Pokémon dives into the ocean,\\ncatching prey by "
"electrocuting them."
msgstr ""
"Quand le vent souffle dans ses ailes,\\nses os produisent de "
"l’électricité.\\nIl plonge dans l’océan et électrocute\\nses proies."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2633
msgid "KILOWATTREL"
msgstr "FULGULAIRO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2636
msgid "Frigatebird"
msgstr "Frégate"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2639
msgid ""
"It uses its throat sac to store\\nelectricity generated by its "
"wings.\\nThere's hardly any oil in its feathers,\\nso it is a poor swimmer."
msgstr ""
"Il stocke dans sa poche gulaire\\nl’électricité produite par ses "
"ailes.\\nSes plumes étant peu grasses, il\\nnage très mal."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2698
msgid "MASCHIFF"
msgstr "GRONDOGUE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2701
msgid "Rascal"
msgstr "Jeunot"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2704
msgid ""
"Its well-developed jaw and fangs\\nare strong enough to crunch "
"through\\nboulders, and its thick fat makes\\nfor an excellent defense."
msgstr ""
"Sa mâchoire et ses crocs puissants\\nbroient les rochers, et son "
"épaisse\\ngraisse lui offre une excellente\\ndéfense."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2763
msgid "MABOSSTIFF"
msgstr "DOGRINO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2766
msgid "Boss"
msgstr "Parrain"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2769
msgid ""
"Mabosstiff loves playing with\\nchildren. Though usually gentle, it\\ntakes "
"on an intimidating look when\\nprotecting its family."
msgstr ""
"Dogrino adore jouer avec les enfants.\\nD’ordinaire doux, il prend un "
"air\\nintimidant pour protéger\\nsa famille."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2828
msgid "SHROODLE"
msgstr "GRIBOURAIGNE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2831
msgid "Toxic Mouse"
msgstr "Souris Venin"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2834
msgid ""
"To keep enemies away from its\\nterritory, it paints markings around "
"its\\nnest using a poisonous liquid that\\nhas an acrid odor."
msgstr ""
"Pour éloigner les intrus, il trace\\ndes marques autour de son nid avec\\nun"
" liquide toxique à l’odeur âcre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2893
msgid "GRAFAIAI"
msgstr "TAG-TAG"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2896
msgid "Toxic Monkey"
msgstr "Singe Venin"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2899
msgid ""
"Each Grafaiai paints its own\\nindividual pattern, and it will paint "
"that\\nsame pattern over and over again\\nthroughout its life."
msgstr ""
"Chaque Tag-Tag peint son propre\\nmotif et le reproduit encore et\\nencore "
"tout au long de sa vie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2958
msgid "BRAMBLIN"
msgstr "VIROVENT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2961
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3026
msgid "Tumbleweed"
msgstr "Virevoltant"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:2964
msgid ""
"A soul unable to move on to the\\nafterlife was blown around by the "
"wind\\nuntil it got tangled up with dried\\ngrass and became a Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"Une âme incapable de gagner l’au-delà\\na erré au gré du vent, puis "
"s’est\\nempêtrée dans des herbes sèches\\npour devenir un Pokémon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3023
msgid "BRAMBLEGHAST"
msgstr "VIREVORREUR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3029
msgid ""
"It will open the branches of its\\nhead to envelop its prey. Once "
"it\\nabsorbs all the life energy it needs, it\\nexpels the prey and discards"
" it."
msgstr ""
"Il ouvre les branches de sa tête pour\\nenvelopper sa proie. "
"Rassasié\\nd’énergie vitale, il la recrache\\net l’abandonne."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3090
msgid "TOEDSCOOL"
msgstr "TERRACOOL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3093
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3160
msgid "Woodear"
msgstr "Champiméduse"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3096
msgid ""
"Though it looks like Tentacool,\\nToedscool is a completely "
"different\\nspecies. Its legs may be thin, but it\\ncan run at a speed of 30"
" mph."
msgstr ""
"Il ressemble à Tentacool, mais\\nTerracool est une tout autre "
"espèce.\\nMalgré ses pattes fines, il peut\\ncourir à 50 km/h."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3157
msgid "TOEDSCRUEL"
msgstr "TERRACRUEL"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3163
msgid ""
"These Pokémon gather into groups\\nand form colonies deep within\\nforests. "
"They absolutely hate it when\\nstrangers approach."
msgstr ""
"Ces Pokémon se regroupent en\\ncolonies au plus profond des forêts.\\nIls "
"détestent que des inconnus\\ns’approchent."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3222
msgid "KLAWF"
msgstr "CRAPAROI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3225
msgid "Ambush"
msgstr "Embuscade"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3228
msgid ""
"Klawf hangs upside-down from\\ncliffs, waiting for prey. But Klawf "
"can't\\nremain in this position for long\\nbecause its blood rushes to its "
"head."
msgstr ""
"Craparoi guette ses proies suspendu\\nà l’envers aux falaises. Mais il "
"ne\\ntient pas longtemps ainsi: le sang\\nlui monte à la tête."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3288
msgid "CAPSAKID"
msgstr "PIMITO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3291
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3356
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3426
msgid "Spicy Pepper"
msgstr "Habanero"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3294
msgid ""
"The more sunlight this Pokémon\\nbathes in, the more spicy chemicals "
"are\\nproduced by its body, and thus the\\nspicier its moves become."
msgstr ""
"Plus il prend le soleil, plus son\\ncorps produit de substances "
"épicées,\\net plus ses capacités deviennent\\npiquantes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3353
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3419
msgid "SCOVILLAIN"
msgstr "SCOVILAIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3359
msgid ""
"The green head has turned vicious\\ndue to the spicy chemicals\\nstimulating"
" its brain. Once it goes on a\\nrampage, there is no stopping it."
msgstr ""
"La tête verte est devenue féroce,\\nses substances épicées lui "
"stimulant\\nle cerveau. Une fois déchaînée,\\nrien ne peut l’arrêter."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3429
msgid ""
"Mega Evolution has dialed up this\\nPokémon's spiciness. It swings "
"its\\n“necktie” around to wallop its foes."
msgstr ""
"La Méga-Evolution a encore relevé le\\npiquant de ce Pokémon. Il "
"fait\\ntournoyer sa “cravate” pour rosser\\nses ennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3479
msgid "RELLOR"
msgstr "LEBOULEROU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3482
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3547
msgid "Rolling"
msgstr "Rouleur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3485
msgid ""
"This Pokémon creates a mud ball by\\nmixing sand and dirt with "
"psychic\\nenergy. It treasures its mud ball more\\nthan its own life."
msgstr ""
"Il façonne une boule de boue en\\nmêlant sable et terre à son "
"énergie\\npsychique. Il y tient plus qu’à\\nsa propre vie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3544
msgid "RABSCA"
msgstr "BERASCA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3550
msgid ""
"The body that supports the ball\\nbarely moves. Therefore, it is "
"thought\\nthat the true body of this Pokémon\\nis actually inside the ball."
msgstr ""
"Le corps qui soutient la boule bouge\\nà peine. On pense donc que le "
"vrai\\ncorps de ce Pokémon se trouve en\\nfait dans la boule."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3609
msgid "FLITTLE"
msgstr "FLOTILLON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3612
msgid "Frill"
msgstr "Froufrou"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3615
msgid ""
"Flittle's toes levitate about half\\nan inch above the ground because "
"of\\nthe psychic power emitted from the\\nfrills on the Pokémon's belly."
msgstr ""
"Les pieds de Flotillon lévitent à un\\ncentimètre du sol grâce à "
"l’énergie\\npsychique émise par les franges\\nde son ventre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3674
msgid "ESPATHRA"
msgstr "CLEOPSYTRA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3677
msgid "Ostrich"
msgstr "Autruche"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3680
msgid ""
"It immobilizes opponents by\\nbathing them in psychic power from its\\nlarge"
" eyes. Despite its appearance, it\\nhas a vicious temperament."
msgstr ""
"Il immobilise l’ennemi en le baignant\\nde l’énergie psychique de ses "
"grands\\nyeux. Malgré son allure, il a un\\ncaractère féroce."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3739
msgid "TINKATINK"
msgstr "FORGERETTE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3742
msgid "Metalsmith"
msgstr "Forge"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3745
msgid ""
"This Pokémon pounds iron scraps\\ntogether to make a hammer. It "
"will\\nremake the hammer again and again until\\nit's satisfied with the "
"result."
msgstr ""
"Il frappe des débris de fer pour se\\nfabriquer un marteau. Il le "
"refait\\nencore et encore jusqu’à ce qu’il\\nsoit satisfait du résultat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3804
msgid "TINKATUFF"
msgstr "FORGELLA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3807
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3871
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "Marteau"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3810
msgid ""
"These Pokémon make their homes in\\npiles of scrap metal. They test "
"the\\nstrength of each other's hammers by\\nsmashing them together."
msgstr ""
"Ces Pokémon vivent dans des tas de\\nferraille. Ils testent la solidité "
"de\\nleurs marteaux en les frappant les uns\\ncontre les autres."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3868
msgid "TINKATON"
msgstr "FORGELINA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3874
msgid ""
"The hammer tops 220 pounds, yet it\\ngets swung around easily by\\nTinkaton "
"as it steals whatever it pleases\\nand carries its plunder back home."
msgstr ""
"Son marteau pèse plus de 100 kg, mais\\nForgelina le manie sans peine. Il "
"vole\\ntout ce qui lui plaît et rapporte son\\nbutin chez lui."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3933
msgid "WIGLETT"
msgstr "TAUPIKEAU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3936
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4000
msgid "Garden Eel"
msgstr "Congre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3939
msgid ""
"This Pokémon can pick up the scent\\nof a Veluza just over 65 feet "
"away\\nand will hide itself in the sand."
msgstr ""
"Il flaire un Délestin à 20 m de\\ndistance et s’enfouit alors dans\\nle "
"sable."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:3997
msgid "WUGTRIO"
msgstr "TRIOPIKEAU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4003
msgid ""
"A variety of fish Pokémon, Wugtrio\\nwas once considered to be a\\nregional "
"form of Dugtrio."
msgstr ""
"Triopikeau, un Pokémon poisson, fut\\njadis considéré comme une "
"forme\\nrégionale de Triopikeur."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4061
msgid "BOMBIRDIER"
msgstr "LESTOMBAILE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4064
msgid "Item Drop"
msgstr "Délesteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4067
msgid ""
"Bombirdier uses the apron on its\\nchest to bundle up food, which "
"it\\ncarries back to its nest. It enjoys\\ndropping things that make loud "
"noises."
msgstr ""
"Lestombaile emballe sa nourriture\\ndans le tablier de son poitrail "
"pour\\nla rapporter au nid. Il adore lâcher\\ndes objets bruyants."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4127
msgid "FINIZEN"
msgstr "DOFIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4130
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4194
msgid "Dolphin"
msgstr "Dauphin"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4133
msgid ""
"Its water ring is made from\\nseawater mixed with a sticky fluid "
"that\\nFinizen secretes from its blowhole."
msgstr ""
"Son anneau d’eau est fait d’eau de\\nmer mêlée à un fluide collant "
"que\\nDofin sécrète par son évent."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4191
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4256
msgid "PALAFIN"
msgstr "SUPERDOFIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4197
msgid ""
"This Pokémon changes its appearance\\nif it hears its allies calling "
"for\\nhelp. Palafin will never show\\nanybody its moment of transformation."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon change d’apparence s’il\\nentend ses alliés appeler à "
"l’aide.\\nSuperdofin ne laisse jamais personne\\nvoir sa transformation."

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#. patch FR actuel : Super Héros
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4259
msgid "Hero"
msgstr "HEROS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4262
msgid ""
"This Pokémon's ancient genes have\\nawakened. It is now so "
"extraordinarily\\nstrong that it can easily lift a\\ncruise ship with one "
"fin."
msgstr ""
"Ses gènes ancestraux se sont éveillés.\\nIl est désormais si fort qu’il "
"peut\\nsoulever un paquebot d’une seule\\nnageoire."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4324
msgid "VAROOM"
msgstr "VROMBI"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4327
msgid "Single-Cyl"
msgstr "Monocylindre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4330
msgid ""
"The steel section is Varoom's\\nactual body. This Pokémon clings to\\nrocks "
"and converts the minerals within\\ninto energy to fuel its activities."
msgstr ""
"La partie en acier est le vrai corps\\nde Vrombi. Il s’agrippe aux "
"rochers\\net en convertit les minéraux en\\nénergie pour s’activer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4389
msgid "REVAVROOM"
msgstr "VROMBOTOR"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4392
msgid "Multi-Cyl"
msgstr "Polycylindre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4395
msgid ""
"It creates a gas out of poison and\\nminerals from rocks. It "
"then\\ndetonates the gas in its cylinders- now\\nnumbering eight-to generate"
" energy."
msgstr ""
"Il crée un gaz à partir de poison et\\nde minéraux tirés des roches, "
"puis\\nle fait détoner dans ses huit\\ncylindres pour produire de l’énergie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4454
msgid "CYCLIZAR"
msgstr "MOTORIZARD"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4460
msgid ""
"It can sprint at over 70 mph while\\ncarrying a human. The rider's "
"body\\nheat warms Cyclizar's back and lifts\\nthe Pokémon's spirit."
msgstr ""
"Il peut filer à plus de 110 km/h\\nen portant un humain. La chaleur "
"du\\ncavalier réchauffe le dos de\\nMotorizard et lui remonte le moral."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4520
msgid "ORTHWORM"
msgstr "FERDETER"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4523
msgid "Earthworm"
msgstr "Ver de Terre"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4526
msgid ""
"When attacked, this Pokémon will\\nwield the tendrils on its body "
"like\\nfists and pelt the opponent with a\\nstorm of punches."
msgstr ""
"Attaqué, il manie les vrilles de son\\ncorps comme des poings et "
"bombarde\\nl’adversaire d’une pluie de coups."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4586
msgid "GLIMMET"
msgstr "GERMECLAT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4592
msgid ""
"Glimmet's toxic mineral crystals\\nlook just like flower petals. "
"This\\nPokémon scatters poisonous powder like\\npollen to protect itself."
msgstr ""
"Les cristaux toxiques de Germéclat\\nressemblent à des pétales. Il "
"répand\\nune poudre toxique comme du pollen\\npour se protéger."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4652
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4719
msgid "GLIMMORA"
msgstr "FLORECLAT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4658
msgid ""
"Glimmora's petals are made of\\ncrystallized poison energy. It "
"has\\nrecently become evident that these\\npetals resemble Tera Jewels."
msgstr ""
"Les pétales de Floréclat sont faits\\nd’énergie toxique cristallisée. On\\na"
" récemment découvert qu’ils\\nressemblent aux Joyaux Téracristal."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4729
msgid ""
"Glimmora's petals-now larger and\\nseparated from its main body-"
"rotate\\naround it to provide defense while\\ncattering poisonous fragments."
msgstr ""
"Ses pétales, plus grands et détachés\\nde son corps, tournent autour de "
"lui\\npour le défendre en dispersant des\\néclats venimeux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4781
msgid "GREAVARD"
msgstr "TOUTOMBE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4784
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4849
msgid "Ghost Dog"
msgstr "Fantôchien"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4787
msgid ""
"This friendly Pokémon doesn't like\\nbeing alone. Pay it even "
"the\\nslightest bit of attention, and it will\\nfollow you forever."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon amical déteste être seul.\\nAccordez-lui la moindre "
"attention\\net il vous suivra pour toujours."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4846
msgid "HOUNDSTONE"
msgstr "TOMBERRO"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4852
msgid ""
"Houndstone spends most of its\\ntime sleeping in graveyards. Among all\\nthe"
" dog Pokémon, this one is most\\nloyal to its master."
msgstr ""
"Tomberro passe le plus clair de son\\ntemps à dormir dans les "
"cimetières.\\nDe tous les Pokémon chiens, c’est\\nle plus fidèle à son "
"maître."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4911
msgid "FLAMIGO"
msgstr "FLAMENROULE"

#. source : SoulSilver FR officiel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4914
msgid "Synchronize"
msgstr "Synchro"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4917
msgid ""
"Thanks to a behavior of theirs\\nknown as “synchronizing,” an entire\\nflock"
" of these Pokémon can attack\\nsimultaneously in perfect harmony."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à un comportement appelé\\n“synchronisation”, toute une nuée\\nde ces "
"Pokémon peut attaquer\\nen parfaite harmonie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4977
msgid "CETODDLE"
msgstr "PIETACE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4980
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5045
msgid "Terra Whale"
msgstr "Baleinapied"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:4983
msgid ""
"This species left the ocean and\\nbegan living on land a very long "
"time\\nago. It seems to be closely related\\nto Wailmer."
msgstr ""
"Cette espèce a quitté l’océan pour\\nla terre ferme il y a très "
"longtemps.\\nElle serait proche parente\\nde Wailmer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5042
msgid "CETITAN"
msgstr "BALBALEZE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5048
msgid ""
"Ice energy builds up in the horn on\\nits upper jaw, causing the horn "
"to\\nreach cryogenic temperatures that\\nfreeze its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"L’énergie glaciale accumulée dans\\nla corne de sa mâchoire la rend\\nsi "
"froide qu’elle gèle tout\\nalentour."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5107
msgid "VELUZA"
msgstr "DELESTIN"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5110
msgid "Jettison"
msgstr "Décharné"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5113
msgid ""
"Veluza has excellent regenerative\\ncapabilities. It sheds spare "
"flesh\\nfrom its body to boost its agility,\\nthen charges at its prey."
msgstr ""
"Délestin a d’excellentes capacités\\nde régénération. Il se déleste de "
"sa\\nchair superflue pour gagner en\\nagilité, puis fonce sur sa proie."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5174
msgid "DONDOZO"
msgstr "OYACATA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5177
msgid "Big Catfish"
msgstr "Grand Silure"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5180
msgid ""
"It treats Tatsugiri like its boss\\nand follows it loyally. "
"Though\\npowerful, Dondozo is apparently not very\\nsmart."
msgstr ""
"Il considère Nigirigon comme son chef\\net le suit fidèlement. Bien "
"que\\npuissant, Oyacata ne serait pas\\ntrès malin."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5241
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5308
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5374
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5441
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5499
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5557
msgid "TATSUGIRI"
msgstr "NIGIRIGON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5244
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5311
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5377
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5448
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5506
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5564
msgid "Mimicry"
msgstr "Mimétisme"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5247
msgid ""
"This is a small dragon Pokémon. It\\nlives inside the mouth of Dondozo "
"to\\nprotect itself from enemies on the\\noutside."
msgstr ""
"Ce petit Pokémon Dragon vit dans\\nla bouche d’Oyacata pour se "
"protéger\\ndes ennemis du dehors."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5314
msgid ""
"This Pokémon tricks its opponents\\nby playing dead. It is small and\\nweak,"
" but it uses its smarts to survive."
msgstr ""
"Il trompe l’ennemi en faisant le\\nmort. Petit et faible, il compte\\nsur sa"
" ruse pour survivre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5380
msgid ""
"It's one of the most intelligent\\ndragon Pokémon. It camouflages "
"itself\\nby inflating its throat sac."
msgstr ""
"C’est l’un des Pokémon Dragon les\\nplus intelligents. Il se camoufle\\nen "
"gonflant sa poche gulaire."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5451
msgid ""
"Tatsugiri's brain has been invigorated\\nby Mega Evolution, making it "
"even\\nwilier. It can create and command\\ncopies of itself."
msgstr ""
"La Méga-Evolution a stimulé le\\ncerveau de NIGIRIGON, qui est "
"devenu\\nencore plus rusé. Il peut créer des\\ncopies de lui-même et les "
"commander."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5509
msgid ""
"It solidifies the energy of Mega Evolution,\\nbuilding up an overflowing "
"pile to launch\\nas projectiles. These projectiles explode\\non contact."
msgstr ""
"Il solidifie l’énergie de la\\nMéga-Evolution et en accumule tant\\lqu’elle "
"déborde. Il la lance en\\lprojectiles explosant au contact."

#. source : traduction nouvelle
#. lot : E_menus_donnees
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5567
msgid ""
"Using the energy of Mega Evolution, it\\ncreates a dish to ride upon, "
"allowing it\\nto move with total freedom-even through\\nthe air."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à l’énergie de la Méga-Evolution, il\\ncrée une assiette sur laquelle "
"il se\\ndéplace en toute liberté, même dans les\\nairs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5619
